<v sidious>Queen Amidala is young and naive.</v>

235
00:19:05.354 --> 00:19:08.608
<v sidious>You will find controlling her will not be difficult.</v>

236
00:19:08.774 --> 00:19:10.651
<v gunray>Yes, my lord.</v>

237
00:19:12.236 --> 00:19:15.239
<v rune-haako>You didn't tell him about the missing Jedi.</v>

238
00:19:15.281 --> 00:19:20.202
<v gunray>No need to report that to him until we have something to report.</v>

239
00:19:24.248 --> 00:19:28.085
<v jar-jar>Where wesa goin?</v>
