<v qui-gon>Head for that outcropping.</v>

253
00:20:32.608 --> 00:20:34.443
<v jar-jar>Oh, boy.</v>

254
00:21:09.687 --> 00:21:11.814
<v role-battle-droid>Viceroy, we have captured the queen.</v>

255
00:21:12.273 --> 00:21:14.942
