<v gunray>will persuade you to see our point of view.</v>

263
00:21:55.775 --> 00:21:57.777
<v gunray>Commander.</v>
<v role-battle-droid>Yes, sir.</v>

264
00:21:57.818 --> 00:22:01.364
<v gunray>Process them.</v>
<v role-battle-droid>Captain, take them to Camp 4.</v>

265
00:22:01.405 --> 00:22:03.407
<v role-captain>Roger, roger.</v>

266
00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:00.631
<v qui-gon>We should leave the street, Your Highness.</v>

267
