<v panaka>Get their weapons.</v>

268
00:23:02.758 --> 00:23:05.761
<v jar-jar>Whoa! Yousa guys bombad!</v>

269
00:23:07.888 --> 00:23:09.849
<v qui-gon>We're ambassadors for the Supreme Chancellor.</v>

270
00:23:09.890 --> 00:23:11.930
<v sio-bibble>Your negotiations seemed to have failed, Ambassador.</v>

271
00:23:12.059 --> 00:23:13.936
<v qui-gon>The negotiations never took place.</v>

272
00:23:13.978 --> 00:23:16.480
<v qui-gon>It's urgent that we make contact with the Republic.</v>

273
00:23:16.522 --> 00:23:18.774
<v panaka>They've knocked out all our communications.</v>

274
00:23:18.816 --> 00:23:19.984
