275
00:23:20.025 --> 00:23:21.902
<v panaka>In the main hangar. This way.</v>

276
00:23:27.408 --> 00:23:30.161
<v panaka>There are too many of them.</v>
<v qui-gon>That won't be a problem.</v>

277
00:23:30.202 --> 00:23:31.787
<v qui-gon>Your Highness, under the circumstances,</v>

278
00:23:31.829 --> 00:23:33.789
<v qui-gon>I suggest you come to Coruscant with us.</v>

279
00:23:33.873 --> 00:23:37.042
<v padme>Thank you, Ambassador, but my place is with my people.</v>

280
00:23:37.084 --> 00:23:39.753
<v qui-gon>They will kill you if you stay.</v>
<v sio-bibble>They wouldn't dare.</v>

281
00:23:39.795 --> 00:23:42.548
<v panaka>They need her to sign a treaty to make this invasion legal.</v>

282
00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:43.841
<v panaka>They can't afford to kill her.</v>

283
00:23:43.883 --> 00:23:45.902
<v qui-gon>There is something else behind all this, Your Highness.</v>

284
00:23:45.926 --> 00:23:47.928
<v qui-gon>There's no logic in the Federation's move here.</v>

285
00:23:47.970 --> 00:23:50.014
<v qui-gon>My feelings tell me they will destroy you.</v>

286
00:23:50.139 --> 00:23:52.766
<v sio-bibble>Our only hope is for the senate to side with us.</v>

287
00:23:52.808 --> 00:23:55.102
<v sio-bibble>Senator Palpatine will need your help.</v>

288
00:23:55.603 --> 00:23:59.440
<v padme>Either choice presents great danger to us all.</v>

289
00:23:59.481 --> 00:24:01.150
<v padme>We are brave, Your Highness.</v>

290
00:24:01.192 --> 00:24:04.737
<v qui-gon>If you are to leave, Your Highness, it must be now.</v>

291
00:24:05.321 --> 00:24:07.198
<v padme>Then I will plead our case to the senate.</v>

292
00:24:08.115 --> 00:24:10.034
<v padme>Be careful, Governor.</v>

293
00:24:18.959 --> 00:24:22.213
<v panaka>We'll need to free those pilots.</v>

294
00:24:22.379 --> 00:24:24.381
<v obi-wan>I'll deal with that.</v>

295
00:24:27.551 --> 00:24:28.677
<v role-droid>Halt!</v>

296
00:24:28.719 --> 00:24:30.319
<v qui-gon>I'm ambassador to the Supreme Chancellor.</v>

297
00:24:30.346 --> 00:24:32.223
<v qui-gon>I'm taking these people to Coruscant.</v>

298
00:24:32.431 --> 00:24:35.601
<v role-droid>Where are you taking them?</v>
<v qui-gon>To Coruscant.</v>

299
00:24:35.768 --> 00:24:38.479
<v role-droid>Coruscant? That doesn't compute.</v>

300
00:24:38.812 --> 00:24:40.272
<v role-droid>Wait. You're under arrest.</v>

301
00:24:45.778 --> 00:24:46.862
<v panaka>Come on. Move!</v>

302
00:24:52.493 --> 00:24:53.577
<v obi-wan>Go!</v>

303
00:25:19.311 --> 00:25:22.606
<v obi-wan>Now, stay here and keep out of trouble.</v>

304
00:25:25.985 --> 00:25:29.071
<v jar-jar>Hello, boyos.</v>

305
00:25:34.994 --> 00:25:36.120
<v ric-olie>There's the blockade.</v>

306
00:25:46.922 --> 00:25:48.202
<v ric-olie>The shield generator's been hit!</v>

307
00:25:56.765 --> 00:25:58.183
<v jar-jar>How wude!</v>

308
00:26:08.152 --> 00:26:09.945
<v obi-wan>We're losing droids fast.</v>

309
00:26:10.821 --> 00:26:13.461
<v panaka>If we can't get the shield generator fixed, we'll be sitting ducks.</v>

310
00:26:15.492 --> 00:26:16.910
<v ric-olie>The shields are gone.</v>

311
00:26:25.002 --> 00:26:26.128
<v ric-olie>The power's back!</v>

312
00:26:29.089 --> 00:26:32.468
<v ric-olie>That little droid did it. He bypassed the main power drive.</v>

313
00:26:32.718 --> 00:26:34.970
<v ric-olie>Deflector shields up at maximum.</v>

314
00:26:44.855 --> 00:26:46.735
<v ric-olie>There's not enough power to get us to Coruscant.</v>

315
00:26:47.149 --> 00:26:48.442
<v ric-olie>The hyperdrive is leaking.</v>

316
00:26:48.692 --> 00:26:51.487
<v qui-gon>We'll have to land somewhere to refuel and repair the ship.</v>

317
00:26:51.695 --> 00:26:53.947
<v obi-wan>Here, Master. Tatooine.</v>

318
00:26:53.989 --> 00:26:55.532
<v obi-wan>Small, out of the way, poor.</v>

319
