<v panaka>You can't take Her Royal Highness there.</v>

323
00:27:03.248 --> 00:27:04.541
<v panaka>The Hutts are gangsters.</v>

324
00:27:04.583 --> 00:27:05.667
<v panaka>If they discovered her...</v>

325
