<v qui-gon>on a system controlled by the Federation,</v>

327
00:27:09.213 --> 00:27:11.006
<v qui-gon>except that the Hutts aren't looking for her,</v>

328
00:27:11.048 --> 00:27:13.634
<v qui-gon>which gives us the advantage.</v>

329
00:27:17.930 --> 00:27:20.849
<v sidious>And Queen Amidala, has she signed the treaty?</v>

330
