332
00:27:29.400 --> 00:27:32.069
<v sidious>I want that treaty signed.</v>

333
00:27:32.111 --> 00:27:34.405
<v gunray>My lord,</v>

334
00:27:34.446 --> 00:27:36.824
<v gunray>it's impossible to locate the ship.</v>

335
00:27:36.865 --> 00:27:38.992
<v gunray>It's out of our range.</v>

336
00:27:39.034 --> 00:27:42.329
<v sidious>Not for a Sith.</v>

337
00:27:42.371 --> 00:27:44.081
<v sidious>This is my apprentice,</v>

338
00:27:44.123 --> 00:27:46.125
<v sidious>Darth Maul.</v>

339
00:27:47.251 --> 00:27:50.921
<v darth-maul>He will find your lost ship.</v>

340
00:27:55.008 --> 00:27:57.136
<v gunray>This is getting out of hand.</v>

341
00:27:57.177 --> 00:27:59.346
<v gunray>Now there are two of them.</v>

342
00:28:00.055 --> 00:28:02.766
<v rune-haako>We should not have made this bargain.</v>

343
00:28:08.147 --> 00:28:11.525
<v panaka>An extremely well-put-together little droid, Your Highness.</v>

344
00:28:11.567 --> 00:28:14.528
<v panaka>Without a doubt, it saved the ship, as well as our lives.</v>

345
00:28:14.570 --> 00:28:17.781
<v padme>It is to be commended. What is its number?</v>

346
00:28:20.409 --> 00:28:22.619
<v panaka>R2-D2, Your Highness.</v>

347
00:28:22.661 --> 00:28:24.204
<v padme>Thank you, R2-D2.</v>

348
00:28:28.041 --> 00:28:30.169
<v padme>Padmé.</v>

349
00:28:30.961 --> 00:28:33.130
<v padme>Clean this droid up as best you can.</v>

350
00:28:33.464 --> 00:28:35.132
<v padme>It deserves our gratitude.</v>

351
00:28:37.050 --> 00:28:38.343
<v padme>Continue, Captain.</v>

352
00:28:41.180 --> 00:28:42.681
<v qui-gon>Your Highness, with your permission,</v>

353
00:28:42.723 --> 00:28:46.059
<v qui-gon>we're heading for a remote planet called Tatooine.</v>

354
00:28:46.101 --> 00:28:49.521
<v qui-gon>It's in a system far beyond the reach of the Trade Federation.</v>

355
00:28:50.189 --> 00:28:52.357
<v panaka>I do not agree with the Jedi on this.</v>

356
00:28:52.399 --> 00:28:55.736
<v qui-gon>You must trust my judgment, Your Highness.</v>

357
