360
00:29:07.164 --> 00:29:09.249
<v jar-jar>Mesa Jar Jar Binks.</v>

361
00:29:10.083 --> 00:29:11.293
<v padme>You're a Gungan, aren't you?</v>

362
00:29:12.085 --> 00:29:13.754
Uh-huh.

363
00:29:13.796 --> 00:29:17.216
<v padme>How'd you end up here with us?</v>
<v jar-jar>My no know.</v>

364
00:29:17.257 --> 00:29:21.136
