00:29:24.223 --> 00:29:27.684
<v jar-jar>and grabben dat Jedi, and pow, mesa here.</v>

367
00:29:28.852 --> 00:29:31.230
<v jar-jar>Mesa getten berry, berry scared.</v>

368
00:29:37.444 --> 00:29:40.822
<v ric-olie>That's it. Tatooine.</v>
<v obi-wan>There's a settlement.</v>

369
00:29:40.864 --> 00:29:44.743
<v qui-gon>Land near the outskirts. We don't want to attract attention.</v>

370
00:30:02.386 --> 00:30:05.138
<v obi-wan>The hyperdrive generator's gone, Master. We'll need a new one.</v>

371
00:30:05.180 --> 00:30:07.724
<v qui-gon>That'll complicate things. Be wary.</v>

372
00:30:07.766 --> 00:30:10.811
<v qui-gon>I sense a disturbance in the Force.</v>
<v obi-wan>I feel it also, Master.</v>

373
00:30:10.853 --> 00:30:13.772
<v qui-gon>Don't let them send any transmissions.</v>

374
00:30:19.152 --> 00:30:21.196
<v jar-jar>This sun doen murder to mesa skin.</v>

375
00:30:21.238 --> 00:30:23.240
<v panaka>Wait!</v>

376
00:30:24.283 --> 00:30:25.784
<v panaka>Wait.</v>

377
00:30:28.954 --> 00:30:31.832
<v panaka>Her Highness commands you to take her handmaiden with you.</v>

378
00:30:32.291 --> 00:30:35.794
<v qui-gon>No more commands from Her Highness today, Captain.</v>

379
00:30:36.003 --> 00:30:38.005
