<v panaka>She's curious about the planet.</v>

382
00:30:44.803 --> 00:30:45.929
<v qui-gon>This is not a good idea.</v>

383
00:30:46.096 --> 00:30:48.098
<v qui-gon>Stay close to me.</v>

384
00:31:01.528 --> 00:31:04.197
<v qui-gon>Moisture farms, for the most part.</v>

385
00:31:05.616 --> 00:31:09.411
<v qui-gon>Some indigenous tribes and scavengers.</v>

386
00:31:09.620 --> 00:31:11.288
<v qui-gon>The few spaceports like this one</v>

387
00:31:11.330 --> 00:31:13.999
<v qui-gon>are havens for those that don't wish to be found.</v>

388
00:31:14.041 --> 00:31:16.043
<v padme>Like us.</v>

389
00:31:17.210 --> 00:31:19.880
<v jar-jar>Dissen berry berry bad.</v>

390
00:31:19.922 --> 00:31:23.383
<v jar-jar>Oh! Icky icky goo!</v>

391
00:31:36.188 --> 00:31:38.398
<v qui-gon>We'll try one of the smaller dealers.</v>

392
00:31:49.242 --> 00:31:52.412
<v qui-gon>I need parts for a J-type 327 Nubian.</v>

393
00:31:52.454 --> 00:31:56.625
<v watto>(IN ENGLISH) Yes! Nubian. We have lots of that.</v>

394
00:31:59.252 --> 00:32:01.380
<v qui-gon>My droid has a readout of what I need.</v>

395
00:32:12.808 --> 00:32:14.285
<v watto>(IN ENGLISH) So, let me take thee out back, huh?</v>

396
00:32:14.309 --> 00:32:16.937
<v watto>You'll find what you need. (LAUGHS)</v>

397
00:32:18.188 --> 00:32:20.440
Huh?
<v qui-gon>Don't touch anything.</v>

398
00:32:20.482 --> 00:32:21.775
Mmm.

399
00:32:28.407 --> 00:32:29.741
Hmm.

400
00:32:30.242 --> 00:32:33.453
<v anakin>(IN ENGLISH) Are you an angel?</v>
<v padme>What?</v>

401
00:32:33.620 --> 00:32:37.290
<v anakin>An angel. I heard the deep space pilots talk about them.</v>

402
00:32:37.457 --> 00:32:40.419
<v anakin>They're the most beautiful creatures in the universe.</v>

403
00:32:40.460 --> 00:32:43.088
<v anakin>They live on the moons of Iego, I think.</v>

404
00:32:43.630 --> 00:32:45.424
<v padme>You're a funny little boy.</v>

405
00:32:45.841 --> 00:32:47.342
<v padme>How do you know so much?</v>

406
00:32:47.384 --> 00:32:51.304
<v anakin>I listen to all the traders and star pilots who come through here.</v>

407
00:32:51.346 --> 00:32:56.101
<v anakin>I'm a pilot, you know, and someday I'm gonna fly away from this place.</v>

408
00:32:56.143 --> 00:33:00.022
<v padme>You're a pilot?</v>
<v anakin>Mmm-hmm. All my life.</v>

409
00:33:00.188 --> 00:33:02.357
<v padme>How long have you been here?</v>

410
00:33:02.399 --> 00:33:06.278
<v anakin>Since I was very little. Three, I think.</v>

411
00:33:06.319 --> 00:33:09.406
<v anakin>My mom and I were sold to Gardulla the Hutt,</v>

412
00:33:09.448 --> 00:33:12.325
<v anakin>but she lost us betting on the Podraces.</v>

413
00:33:12.451 --> 00:33:14.244
<v padme>You're a slave?</v>

414
00:33:14.286 --> 00:33:18.415
<v anakin>I'm a person, and my name is Anakin.</v>
<v padme>I'm sorry.</v>

415
00:33:19.166 --> 00:33:22.294
<v padme>I don't fully understand. This is a strange place to me.</v>

416
00:33:22.335 --> 00:33:23.628
<v jar-jar>Hmm.</v>

417
00:33:26.465 --> 00:33:29.217
<v jar-jar>Wheres yousa goin?</v>

418
00:33:34.389 --> 00:33:35.807
<v jar-jar>I got ya.</v>
<v anakin>Hey!</v>

419
00:33:35.849 --> 00:33:38.101
What?
<v anakin>Hit the nose.</v>

420
00:33:38.602 --> 00:33:40.020
Oh.

421
00:33:42.773 --> 00:33:46.276
<v watto>A T-14 hyperdrive generator. Thee in luck.</v>

422
00:33:46.318 --> 00:33:49.279
<v watto>I'm the only one hereabouts who has one.</v>

423
00:33:49.321 --> 00:33:52.699
<v watto>But thee might as well buy a new ship. It would be cheaper, huh?</v>

424
00:33:54.117 --> 00:33:55.952
<v watto>Saying of which,</v>

425
00:33:55.994 --> 00:33:58.288
<v watto>how's thee gonna pay for all this, huh?</v>

426
00:33:58.455 --> 00:34:00.373
<v qui-gon>I have 20,000 Republic dataries.</v>

427
00:34:00.540 --> 00:34:02.292
<v watto>Republic credits?</v>

428
00:34:02.334 --> 00:34:05.504
<v watto>Republic credits are no good out here. I need something more real.</v>

429
00:34:05.587 --> 00:34:08.632
<v qui-gon>I don't have anything else, but credits will do fine.</v>

430
00:34:08.673 --> 00:34:12.385
<v watto>No, they won't.</v>
<v qui-gon>Credits will do fine.</v>

431
00:34:12.594 --> 00:34:14.304
<v watto>No, they won't!</v>

432
00:34:14.471 --> 00:34:16.389
<v watto>What, you think you're some kind of Jedi,</v>

433
00:34:16.431 --> 00:34:18.433
<v watto>waving your hand around like that?</v>

434
00:34:18.475 --> 00:34:23.021
<v watto>I'm a Toydarian. Mind tricks don't work on me. Only money.</v>

435
00:34:23.480 --> 00:34:27.400
<v watto>No money, no parts, no deal.</v>

436
00:34:27.651 --> 00:34:31.905
<v watto>And no one else has a T-14 hyperdrive, I promise you that.</v>

437
00:34:38.829 --> 00:34:42.499
<v anakin>Wouldn't have lasted long anyways if I wasn't so good at building things.</v>

438
00:34:46.586 --> 00:34:49.047
<v qui-gon>We're leaving. Jar Jar.</v>

439
00:34:51.424 --> 00:34:53.844
<v padme>I'm glad to have met you, Anakin.</v>

440
00:34:54.094 --> 00:34:55.804
<v anakin>I was glad to meet you too.</v>

441
00:34:57.931 --> 00:34:59.933
<v jar-jar>What?</v>

442
00:35:14.489 --> 00:35:15.532
Yipee!

443
00:35:22.372 --> 00:35:24.624
<v qui-gon>And you're sure there's nothing left on board?</v>

444
00:35:24.666 --> 00:35:26.626
<v obi-wan>A few containers of supplies.</v>

445
00:35:26.960 --> 00:35:30.505
<v obi-wan>The queen's wardrobe, maybe, but not enough for you to barter with,</v>

446
00:35:30.547 --> 00:35:32.382
<v obi-wan>not in the amount you're talking about.</v>

447
00:35:32.507 --> 00:35:35.302
<v qui-gon>All right. I'm sure another solution will present itself.</v>

448
00:35:35.343 --> 00:35:36.845
<v qui-gon>I'll check back later.</v>

449
00:35:37.637 --> 00:35:39.514
<v jar-jar>Noah gain! Noah gain.</v>

450
00:35:39.556 --> 00:35:42.350
<v jar-jar>Da beings hereabouts, cawazy!</v>

451
00:35:42.559 --> 00:35:45.061
<v jar-jar>Wesa be wobbed un crunched!</v>

452
00:35:45.103 --> 00:35:48.148
<v qui-gon>Not likely. We have nothing of value. That's our problem.</v>

453
00:35:58.491 --> 00:36:01.453
<v jar-jar>Oh. Mooie-mooie.</v>

454
00:36:02.120 --> 00:36:03.205
Hey, hey!

455
00:36:05.207 --> 00:36:06.666
Huh? Wanga?

456
00:36:14.299 --> 00:36:16.009
<v jar-jar>Oops. (WHISTLES)</v>

457
00:36:21.765 --> 00:36:23.516
<v jar-jar>Who, mesa?</v>

458
00:36:26.394 --> 00:36:27.771
<v jar-jar>Ouch.</v>

459
00:36:48.833 --> 00:36:50.377
<v anakin>(IN ENGLISH) Hi.</v>
<v qui-gon>Hi there.</v>

460
00:36:50.418 --> 00:36:52.898
<v anakin>Your buddy here was about to be turned into orange goo.</v>

461
00:36:53.380 --> 00:36:54.631
<v anakin>He picked a fight with a Dug,</v>

462
00:36:54.756 --> 00:36:57.175
<v anakin>an especially dangerous Dug called Sebulba.</v>

463
00:36:57.425 --> 00:37:00.971
<v jar-jar>Mesa haten crunchen. Das da las ting mesa want.</v>

464
00:37:01.471 --> 00:37:05.267
<v qui-gon>Nevertheless, the boy is right. You were heading into trouble.</v>

465
00:37:05.725 --> 00:37:07.060
<v qui-gon>Thanks, my young friend.</v>

466
00:37:08.019 --> 00:37:09.396
<v jar-jar>But... But...</v>

467
00:37:09.437 --> 00:37:11.481
<v jar-jar>But mesa doen nutten!</v>

468
00:37:19.614 --> 00:37:22.534
<v obi-wan>This storm will slow them down.</v>

469
00:37:22.575 --> 00:37:24.953
<v panaka>Looks pretty bad.</v>

470
00:37:25.620 --> 00:37:27.515
<v panaka>Panaka.</v>
<v role-pilot>Receiving a message from home.</v>

471
00:37:27.539 --> 00:37:29.165
<v panaka>We'll be right there.</v>

472
00:37:36.256 --> 00:37:38.383
<v anakin>Here, you'll like these pallies.</v>

473
00:37:38.508 --> 00:37:40.927
<v anakin>Here.</v>
<v qui-gon>Thank you.</v>

474
00:37:42.303 --> 00:37:44.514
<v jira>Oh, my bones are aching.</v>

475
00:37:44.806 --> 00:37:49.102
<v jira>Storm's coming up, Ani. You better get home quick.</v>

476
00:37:49.352 --> 00:37:52.314
<v anakin>Do you have shelter?</v>
<v qui-gon>We'll head back to our ship.</v>

477
00:37:52.355 --> 00:37:55.316
<v anakin>Is it far?</v>
<v padme>It's on the outskirts.</v>

478
00:37:55.358 --> 00:37:57.402
<v anakin>You'll never reach the outskirts in time.</v>

479
00:37:57.569 --> 00:38:01.531
<v anakin>Sandstorms are very, very dangerous.</v>

480
00:38:01.573 --> 00:38:04.826
<v anakin>Come on. I'll take you to my place.</v>

481
00:38:18.715 --> 00:38:19.883
<v anakin>Mom!</v>

482
00:38:19.924 --> 00:38:23.595
<v anakin>Mom, I'm home!</v>
<v jar-jar>Oh. Dissen cozy.</v>

483
00:38:23.762 --> 00:38:26.181
<v anakin>These are my friends, Mom.</v>
<v jar-jar>Hello.</v>

484
00:38:26.389 --> 00:38:29.809
<v qui-gon>I'm Qui-Gon Jinn.</v>
<v anakin>I'm building a droid. You wanna see?</v>

485
00:38:30.060 --> 00:38:32.395
<v qui-gon>Your son was kind enough to offer us shelter.</v>

486
00:38:32.562 --> 00:38:35.899
<v anakin>Come on. I'll show you 3PO.</v>
<v jar-jar>Oh. Mooie-mooie.</v>

487
00:38:44.115 --> 00:38:47.535
<v anakin>Isn't he great? He's not finished yet.</v>

488
00:38:47.577 --> 00:38:48.953
<v padme>He's wonderful.</v>

489
00:38:50.246 --> 00:38:51.790
<v anakin>You really like him?</v>

490
00:38:51.956 --> 00:38:54.918
<v anakin>He's a protocol droid to help Mom. Watch.</v>

491
00:38:56.461 --> 00:38:57.629
<v role-droid>Oh.</v>

492
00:38:59.339 --> 00:39:00.799
<v role-droid>Where is everybody?</v>

493
00:39:00.840 --> 00:39:04.052
Whoops. Yeah.

494
00:39:05.095 --> 00:39:06.513
<v c-3po>Oh. Hello.</v>

495
00:39:06.554 --> 00:39:09.808
<v c-3po>I am C-3PO, human-cyborg relations.</v>

496
00:39:10.016 --> 00:39:11.684
<v c-3po>How might I serve you?</v>

497
00:39:11.726 --> 00:39:13.812
<v padme>He's perfect.</v>
<v c-3po>Perfect.</v>

498
00:39:13.853 --> 00:39:16.648
<v anakin>When the storm is over, I'll show you my racer.</v>

499
00:39:16.689 --> 00:39:18.316
<v anakin>I'm building a Podracer.</v>

500
00:39:19.734 --> 00:39:22.445
<v c-3po>I'm not sure this floor is entirely stable.</v>

501
00:39:22.654 --> 00:39:25.657
<v c-3po>Hello. I don't believe we have been introduced.</v>

502
00:39:27.575 --> 00:39:29.702
<v c-3po>R2-D2. A pleasure to meet you.</v>

503
00:39:29.744 --> 00:39:32.831
<v c-3po>I am C-3PO, human-cyborg relations.</v>

504
00:39:35.834 --> 00:39:38.753
<v c-3po>I beg your pardon, but what do you mean, "naked"?</v>

505
00:39:40.547 --> 00:39:43.883
<v c-3po>My parts are showing? My goodness!</v>

506
00:39:48.763 --> 00:39:50.723
<v sio-bibble>The death toll is catastrophic.</v>

507
00:39:50.765 --> 00:39:53.184
<v sio-bibble>We must bow to their wishes.</v>

508
00:39:53.476 --> 00:39:55.437
<v sio-bibble>You must contact me.</v>

509
00:39:55.645 --> 00:39:58.439
<v obi-wan>It's a trick. Send no reply.</v>

510
00:39:58.481 --> 00:40:01.025
<v obi-wan>Send no transmissions of any kind.</v>

511
00:40:02.694 --> 00:40:05.613
<v qui-gon>It sounds like bait to establish a connection trace.</v>

512
00:40:05.864 --> 00:40:09.701
<v obi-wan>What if it is true, and the people are dying?</v>

513
00:40:10.076 --> 00:40:12.954
<v qui-gon>Either way, we're running out of time.</v>

514
00:40:25.717 --> 00:40:27.927
<v darth-maul>Tatooine is sparsely populated.</v>

515
00:40:27.969 --> 00:40:30.847
<v darth-maul>If the trace was correct, I will find them quickly, Master.</v>

516
00:40:30.889 --> 00:40:32.849
<v sidious>Move against the Jedi first.</v>

517
00:40:32.891 --> 00:40:36.144
<v sidious>You will then have no difficulty in taking the queen to Naboo</v>

518
00:40:36.186 --> 00:40:37.645
<v sidious>to sign the treaty.</v>

519
00:40:37.687 --> 00:40:39.981
<v darth-maul>At last we will reveal ourselves to the Jedi.</v>

520
00:40:40.148 --> 00:40:42.775
<v darth-maul>At last we will have revenge.</v>

521
00:40:42.817 --> 00:40:45.778
<v sidious>You have been well-trained, my young apprentice.</v>

522
00:40:45.820 --> 00:40:48.198
<v sidious>They will be no match for you.</v>

523
00:40:52.827 --> 00:40:57.499
<v shmi>All slaves have a transmitter placed inside their bodies somewhere.</v>

524
00:40:58.374 --> 00:41:01.044
<v anakin>I've been working on a scanner to try and locate mine.</v>

525
00:41:01.085 --> 00:41:04.839
<v shmi>Any attempt to escape...</v>
<v anakin>And they blow you up!</v>

526
00:41:04.881 --> 00:41:07.383
<v anakin>Boom!</v>
<v jar-jar>How wude!</v>

527
00:41:07.425 --> 00:41:09.886
<v padme>I can't believe there's still slavery in the galaxy.</v>

528
00:41:09.928 --> 00:41:11.930
<v padme>The Republic's antislavery laws...</v>

529
00:41:11.971 --> 00:41:14.224
<v shmi>The Republic doesn't exist out here.</v>

530
00:41:14.265 --> 00:41:16.392
<v shmi>We must survive on our own.</v>

531
00:41:17.560 --> 00:41:19.938
(GULPS) Xcuse me.

532
00:41:20.939 --> 00:41:23.775
<v anakin>Has anybody ever seen a Podrace?</v>

533
00:41:23.816 --> 00:41:28.279
<v qui-gon>They have Podracing on Malastare. Very fast, very dangerous.</v>

534
00:41:28.863 --> 00:41:30.990
<v anakin>I'm the only human who can do it.</v>

535
00:41:31.115 --> 00:41:34.494
<v qui-gon>You must have Jedi reflexes if you race pods.</v>

536
00:41:35.328 --> 00:41:37.080
<v qui-gon>Don't do that again.</v>

537
00:41:42.001 --> 00:41:44.671
<v anakin>You're a Jedi knight, aren't you?</v>

538
00:41:47.840 --> 00:41:49.300
<v qui-gon>What makes you think that?</v>

539
00:41:49.342 --> 00:41:53.471
<v anakin>I saw your laser sword. Only Jedis carry that kind of weapon.</v>

540
00:41:53.805 --> 00:41:57.225
<v qui-gon>Perhaps I killed a Jedi and took it from him.</v>

541
00:41:57.433 --> 00:41:58.643
<v anakin>I don't think so.</v>

542
00:41:58.810 --> 00:42:01.020
<v anakin>No one can kill a Jedi.</v>

543
00:42:01.562 --> 00:42:03.856
<v qui-gon>I wish that were so.</v>

544
00:42:03.982 --> 00:42:05.858
<v anakin>I had a dream I was a Jedi.</v>

545
00:42:05.900 --> 00:42:09.112
<v anakin>I came back here and freed all the slaves.</v>

546
00:42:09.404 --> 00:42:12.740
<v anakin>Have you come to free us?</v>
<v qui-gon>No, I'm afraid not.</v>

547
00:42:12.907 --> 00:42:17.078
<v anakin>I think you have. Why else would you be here?</v>

548
00:42:22.208 --> 00:42:24.752
<v qui-gon>I can see there's no fooling you, Anakin.</v>

549
00:42:24.961 --> 00:42:27.922
<v qui-gon>We're on our way to Coruscant, the central system in the Republic,</v>

550
00:42:27.964 --> 00:42:29.966
<v qui-gon>on a very important mission.</v>

551
00:42:30.341 --> 00:42:33.386
<v anakin>How did you end up out here in the Outer Rim?</v>

552
00:42:33.428 --> 00:42:37.056
<v padme>Our ship was damaged, and we're stranded here until we can repair it.</v>

553
00:42:37.974 --> 00:42:39.100
<v anakin>I can help.</v>

554
00:42:39.267 --> 00:42:43.146
<v anakin>I can fix anything.</v>
<v qui-gon>I believe you can.</v>

555
00:42:43.646 --> 00:42:45.898
<v qui-gon>But first we must acquire the parts we need.</v>

556
00:42:45.940 --> 00:42:48.985
<v jar-jar>Wit no-nutten mula to trade.</v>

557
00:42:49.027 --> 00:42:52.405
<v padme>These junk dealers must have a weakness of some kind.</v>

558
00:42:52.655 --> 00:42:57.076
<v shmi>Gambling. Everything here revolves around betting on those awful races.</v>

559
00:42:57.118 --> 00:43:01.289
<v qui-gon>Podracing. Greed can be a powerful ally.</v>

560
00:43:01.539 --> 00:43:04.500
<v anakin>I built a racer. It's the fastest ever.</v>

561
00:43:04.542 --> 00:43:06.878
<v anakin>There's a big race tomorrow on Boonta Eve.</v>

562
00:43:06.919 --> 00:43:09.589
<v anakin>You could enter my pod.</v>
<v shmi>Anakin!</v>

563
00:43:09.881 --> 00:43:13.051
<v shmi>Watto won't let you.</v>
<v anakin>Watto doesn't know I've built it.</v>

564
00:43:13.092 --> 00:43:14.927
<v anakin>You could make him think it was yours</v>

565
00:43:14.969 --> 00:43:17.096
<v anakin>and get him to let me pilot it for you.</v>

566
00:43:17.138 --> 00:43:21.517
<v shmi>I don't want you to race. It's awful. I die every time Watto makes you do it.</v>

567
00:43:21.559 --> 00:43:23.853
<v anakin>But, Mom, I love it.</v>

568
00:43:24.354 --> 00:43:27.357
<v anakin>The prize money would more than pay for the parts they need.</v>

569
00:43:28.066 --> 00:43:29.901
<v shmi>Anakin.</v>

570
00:43:30.151 --> 00:43:32.820
<v qui-gon>Your mother's right.</v>

571
00:43:32.945 --> 00:43:36.032
<v qui-gon>Is there anyone friendly to the Republic who can help us?</v>

572
00:43:37.116 --> 00:43:39.077
<v shmi>No.</v>

573
00:43:44.040 --> 00:43:46.834
<v anakin>Mom, you say the biggest problem in this universe</v>

574
00:43:46.876 --> 00:43:48.836
<v anakin>is nobody helps each other.</v>

575
00:43:53.591 --> 00:43:56.719
<v padme>I'm sure Qui-Gon doesn't want to put your son in danger.</v>

576
00:43:56.761 --> 00:43:58.513
<v padme>We'll find some other way.</v>

577
00:43:59.764 --> 00:44:01.015
<v shmi>No.</v>

578
00:44:01.057 --> 00:44:03.684
<v shmi>There is no other way.</v>

579
00:44:03.726 --> 00:44:08.022
<v shmi>I may not like it, but he can help you.</v>

580
00:44:08.689 --> 00:44:11.150
<v shmi>He was meant to help you.</v>

581
00:44:24.122 --> 00:44:26.082
<v padme>Are you sure about this?</v>

582
00:44:26.457 --> 00:44:28.960
<v padme>Trusting our fate to a boy we hardly know?</v>

583
00:44:29.127 --> 00:44:31.087
<v padme>The queen will not approve.</v>

584
00:44:31.129 --> 00:44:33.923
<v qui-gon>The queen doesn't need to know.</v>

585
00:44:34.173 --> 00:44:36.884
<v padme>Well, I don't approve.</v>

586
00:44:36.926 --> 00:44:39.637
<v watto>The boy tells me you want to sponsor him in the race.</v>

587
00:44:39.804 --> 00:44:44.350
<v watto>How can you do this? Not on the Republic credits, I think, huh?</v>

588
00:44:44.392 --> 00:44:47.186
<v qui-gon>My ship will be the entry fee.</v>

589
00:44:48.146 --> 00:44:49.272
<v watto>Oh. Not bad!</v>

590
00:44:49.313 --> 00:44:52.233
<v watto>Not bad, huh? A Nubian, huh?</v>

591
00:44:52.650 --> 00:44:55.820
<v qui-gon>It's in good order, except for the parts I need.</v>

592
00:44:55.862 --> 00:44:57.238
<v watto>What would the boy ride?</v>

593
00:44:57.280 --> 00:45:02.076
<v watto>He smashed up my pod in the last race. It will take some long time to fix it.</v>

594
00:45:02.118 --> 00:45:06.205
<v anakin>It wasn't my fault, really. Sebulba flashed me with his vents.</v>

595
00:45:06.873 --> 00:45:10.126
<v anakin>I actually saved the pod, mostly.</v>

596
00:45:11.043 --> 00:45:13.546
<v watto>That you did, huh. (LAUGHS)</v>

597
00:45:13.588 --> 00:45:16.215
<v watto>The boy's good. No doubts there, huh?</v>

598
00:45:16.382 --> 00:45:20.803
<v qui-gon>I have acquired a pod in a game of chance, the fastest ever built.</v>

599
00:45:21.220 --> 00:45:26.058
<v watto>I hope you didn't kill anyone I know for it, huh?</v>

600
00:45:28.019 --> 00:45:31.689
<v watto>So, you supply the pod and the entry fee,</v>

601
00:45:31.731 --> 00:45:33.149
<v watto>and I supply the boy.</v>

602
00:45:33.191 --> 00:45:37.153
<v watto>We split the winnings, 50-50, I think, huh?</v>

603
00:45:37.195 --> 00:45:38.571
<v qui-gon>If it's going to be 50-50,</v>

604
00:45:38.613 --> 00:45:41.908
<v qui-gon>I suggest you front the cash for the entry.</v>

605
00:45:41.949 --> 00:45:44.076
<v qui-gon>If we win,</v>

606
00:45:44.118 --> 00:45:47.997
<v qui-gon>you keep all the winnings, minus the cost of the parts I need.</v>

607
00:45:48.039 --> 00:45:51.083
<v qui-gon>And if we lose, you keep my ship.</v>

608
00:45:53.669 --> 00:45:55.087
<v qui-gon>Either way, you win.</v>

609
00:45:55.713 --> 00:45:56.964
Hmm...

610
00:46:00.927 --> 00:46:02.845
<v watto>Deal!</v>

611
00:46:19.654 --> 00:46:22.698
<v obi-wan>What if this plan fails, Master?</v>

612
00:46:22.740 --> 00:46:25.284
<v obi-wan>We could be stuck here a very long time.</v>

613
00:46:25.326 --> 00:46:27.912
<v qui-gon>Well, it's too dangerous to call for help,</v>

614
00:46:28.913 --> 00:46:31.541
<v qui-gon>and a ship without a power supply isn't going to get us anywhere.</v>

615
00:46:31.749 --> 00:46:33.793
<v qui-gon>And...</v>

616
00:46:33.834 --> 00:46:36.754
<v qui-gon>There's something about this boy.</v>

617
00:46:42.176 --> 00:46:44.762
<v qui-gon>You should be very proud of your son.</v>

618
00:46:45.555 --> 00:46:47.932
<v qui-gon>He gives without any thought of reward.</v>

619
00:46:48.099 --> 00:46:51.060
<v shmi>Well, he knows nothing of greed.</v>

620
00:46:51.102 --> 00:46:55.106
<v shmi>He has a...</v>
<v qui-gon>He has special powers.</v>

621
00:46:56.607 --> 00:46:57.942
<v shmi>Yes.</v>

622
00:46:58.484 --> 00:47:00.903
<v qui-gon>He can see things before they happen.</v>

623
00:47:00.945 --> 00:47:03.573
<v qui-gon>That's why he appears to have such quick reflexes.</v>

624
00:47:03.781 --> 00:47:05.283
<v qui-gon>It's a Jedi trait.</v>

625
00:47:05.324 --> 00:47:07.451
<v shmi>He deserves better than a slave's life.</v>

626
00:47:07.493 --> 00:47:08.536
<v c-3po>Why, certainly.</v>

627
00:47:08.661 --> 00:47:12.081
<v qui-gon>Had he been born in the Republic, we would have identified him early.</v>

628
00:47:14.083 --> 00:47:18.296
<v qui-gon>The Force is unusually strong with him. That much is clear.</v>

629
00:47:18.462 --> 00:47:20.172
<v qui-gon>Who was his father?</v>

630
00:47:22.925 --> 00:47:24.635
<v shmi>There was no father.</v>

631
00:47:26.304 --> 00:47:29.515
<v shmi>I carried him, I gave birth, I raised him.</v>

632
00:47:30.474 --> 00:47:32.935
<v shmi>I can't explain what happened.</v>

633
00:47:34.770 --> 00:47:36.188
<v shmi>Can you help him?</v>

634
00:47:37.064 --> 00:47:39.066
<v qui-gon>I don't know.</v>

635
00:47:41.402 --> 00:47:44.572
<v qui-gon>I didn't actually come here to free slaves.</v>

636
00:47:51.621 --> 00:47:53.623
Hey, hi, Ani.

637
00:47:53.664 --> 00:47:55.333
Hi.

638
00:47:57.710 --> 00:47:59.462
<v kitster>Wow, a real astro droid.</v>

639
00:48:01.255 --> 00:48:05.343
<v kitster>How did you get so lucky?</v>
<v anakin>That isn't the half of it.</v>

640
00:48:05.384 --> 00:48:08.429
<v anakin>I'm in the Boonta race tomorrow.</v>
<v kitster>What?</v>

641
00:48:08.721 --> 00:48:10.014
<v kitster>With this?</v>

642
00:48:13.225 --> 00:48:15.061
<v amee>You've been working on that thing for years.</v>

643
00:48:15.102 --> 00:48:16.437
<v seek>It's never gonna run.</v>

644
00:48:16.479 --> 00:48:18.606
<v seek>Come on. Let's go and play ball.</v>

645
00:48:18.856 --> 00:48:22.193
<v seek>Keep racing, Ani. You're gonna be bug squash.</v>

646
00:48:29.325 --> 00:48:30.368
<v anakin>Hey, Jar Jar.</v>

647
00:48:31.911 --> 00:48:33.013
<v anakin>Keep away from those energy binders.</v>

648
00:48:33.037 --> 00:48:36.332
<v anakin>If your hand gets caught in the beam, it's gonna go numb for hours.</v>

649
00:48:36.499 --> 00:48:38.084
<v jar-jar>Sorry. Okay.</v>

650
00:48:41.712 --> 00:48:44.423
<v jar-jar>My tongue is fat.</v>

651
00:48:44.674 --> 00:48:47.677
<v jar-jar>My tongue... Wrench.</v>

652
00:48:47.718 --> 00:48:50.221
<v jar-jar>Where is da wrench? Dare it is.</v>

653
00:48:50.262 --> 00:48:51.305
<v jar-jar>Hey.</v>

654
00:48:54.058 --> 00:48:56.477
<v jar-jar>Ani, I'm stuck. Ani...</v>

655
00:48:56.811 --> 00:49:00.481
<v c-3po>You know, I find that Jar Jar creature to be a little odd.</v>

656
00:49:02.400 --> 00:49:05.319
<v kitster>You don't even know if this thing's gonna run.</v>

657
00:49:05.361 --> 00:49:07.363
<v anakin>It will.</v>
<v qui-gon>I think it's time we found out.</v>

658
00:49:07.405 --> 00:49:09.865
<v qui-gon>Here, use this power charge.</v>
<v anakin>Yes, sir!</v>

659
00:49:09.907 --> 00:49:11.867
<v qui-gon>Come on, Kitster. Let's move away.</v>

660
00:49:12.535 --> 00:49:14.203
<v jar-jar>My... My mouth.</v>

661
00:49:14.370 --> 00:49:15.579
<v jar-jar>Ani, I'm stuck.</v>

662
00:49:20.209 --> 00:49:23.003
<v jar-jar>Hey. My tongue is fat. Ani!</v>

663
00:49:23.254 --> 00:49:26.048
<v c-3po>You're quite right. He's very odd indeed.</v>

664
00:49:28.342 --> 00:49:30.052
<v jar-jar>Thank you.</v>

665
00:49:30.594 --> 00:49:31.846
<v jar-jar>Go.</v>

666
00:49:46.736 --> 00:49:50.072
<v anakin>It's working! It's working!</v>

667
00:50:00.541 --> 00:50:03.210
<v qui-gon>Stay still, Ani. Let me clean this cut.</v>

668
00:50:03.794 --> 00:50:07.423
<v anakin>There's so many. Do they all have a system of planets?</v>

669
00:50:08.090 --> 00:50:09.300
<v qui-gon>Most of them.</v>

670
00:50:09.592 --> 00:50:11.510
<v anakin>Has anyone been to 'em all?</v>

671
00:50:13.262 --> 00:50:14.722
<v qui-gon>Not likely.</v>

672
00:50:14.764 --> 00:50:17.725
<v anakin>I wanna be the first one to see 'em all.</v>

673
00:50:18.809 --> 00:50:21.353
<v shmi>Ani, bedtime!</v>
Ow.

674
00:50:21.395 --> 00:50:23.981
<v qui-gon>There we are. Good as new.</v>

675
00:50:24.106 --> 00:50:27.068
<v shmi>Ani, I'm not gonna tell you again.</v>

676
00:50:27.234 --> 00:50:30.696
<v anakin>What are you doing?</v>
<v qui-gon>Checking your blood for infections.</v>

677
00:50:30.738 --> 00:50:34.283
<v qui-gon>Go on. You have a big day tomorrow.</v>

678
00:50:34.408 --> 00:50:36.535
<v qui-gon>Sleep well, Ani.</v>

679
00:50:39.205 --> 00:50:41.290
<v qui-gon>Obi-Wan?</v>
<v obi-wan>Yes, Master?</v>

680
00:50:41.332 --> 00:50:43.876
<v qui-gon>I need an analysis of this blood sample I'm sending you.</v>

681
00:50:44.543 --> 00:50:46.545
<v obi-wan>Wait a minute.</v>

682
00:50:47.546 --> 00:50:49.548
<v qui-gon>I need a midi-chlorian count.</v>

683
00:50:52.802 --> 00:50:55.513
<v obi-wan>The reading is off the chart.</v>

684
00:50:55.554 --> 00:50:57.056
<v obi-wan>Over 20,000.</v>

685
00:50:57.223 --> 00:51:00.976
<v obi-wan>Even Master Yoda doesn't have a midi-chlorian count that high.</v>

686
00:51:01.018 --> 00:51:02.603
<v qui-gon>No Jedi has.</v>

687
00:51:02.895 --> 00:51:04.897
<v obi-wan>What does that mean?</v>

688
00:51:05.606 --> 00:51:07.608
<v qui-gon>I'm not sure.</v>

689
00:52:17.011 --> 00:52:20.389
<v watto>I wanna see your spaceship the moment the race is over.</v>

690
00:52:20.431 --> 00:52:22.016
<v qui-gon>Patience, my blue friend.</v>

691
00:52:22.057 --> 00:52:24.602
<v qui-gon>You'll have your winnings before the suns set.</v>

692
00:52:24.643 --> 00:52:26.562
<v qui-gon>And we'll be far away from here.</v>

693
00:52:26.604 --> 00:52:30.608
<v watto>Not if your ship belongs to me, I think, huh?</v>

694
00:52:30.649 --> 00:52:34.236
<v watto>I warn you, no funny business.</v>

695
00:52:34.278 --> 00:52:37.781
<v qui-gon>You don't think Anakin can win?</v>
<v watto>Don't get me wrong, no.</v>

696
00:52:37.823 --> 00:52:40.075
<v watto>I have great faith in the boy.</v>

697
00:52:40.117 --> 00:52:41.952
<v watto>He's a credit to your race,</v>

698
00:52:41.994 --> 00:52:45.623
<v watto>but Sebulba there is going to win, I think.</v>

699
00:52:47.583 --> 00:52:49.335
<v jar-jar>Oh, no!</v>

700
00:52:53.964 --> 00:52:55.424
<v qui-gon>Why do you think that?</v>

701
00:52:55.549 --> 00:52:58.010
<v watto>He always wins! (LAUGHS)</v>

702
00:52:58.761 --> 00:53:01.680
<v watto>I am betting heavily on Sebulba.</v>

703
00:53:03.515 --> 00:53:06.894
<v qui-gon>I'll take that bet.</v>
<v watto>You what?</v>

704
00:53:07.186 --> 00:53:10.648
<v qui-gon>I'll wager my new racing pod against, say,</v>

705
00:53:11.482 --> 00:53:12.650
<v qui-gon>the boy and his mother.</v>

706
00:53:12.691 --> 00:53:16.278
<v watto>No pod is worth two slaves, not by a long shot.</v>

707
00:53:17.363 --> 00:53:18.864
<v qui-gon>The boy, then.</v>

708
00:53:20.616 --> 00:53:21.700
<v watto>Well...</v>

709
00:53:25.287 --> 00:53:27.748
<v watto>We'll let fate decide, huh?</v>

710
00:53:27.790 --> 00:53:31.293
<v watto>I just happen to have a chance cube here.</v>

711
00:53:31.627 --> 00:53:34.588
<v watto>Blue, it's the boy.</v>

712
00:53:34.630 --> 00:53:38.634
<v watto>Red, his mother.</v>

713
00:53:48.602 --> 00:53:52.690
<v watto>You won this small toss, outlander, but you won't win the race!</v>

714
00:53:52.731 --> 00:53:55.317
<v watto>So it makes little difference!</v>

715
00:54:13.752 --> 00:54:16.463
<v anakin>What'd he mean by that?</v>
<v qui-gon>I'll tell you later.</v>

716
00:54:16.505 --> 00:54:18.215
<v qui-gon>Good morning.</v>

717
00:54:19.633 --> 00:54:20.718
<v c-3po>Oh, my.</v>

718
00:54:20.759 --> 00:54:22.803
<v c-3po>Space travel sounds rather perilous.</v>

719
00:54:25.264 --> 00:54:28.726
<v c-3po>I can assure you, they will never get me onto one of those dreadful starships.</v>

720
00:54:28.809 --> 00:54:32.187
<v kitster>This is so wizard, Ani. I'm sure you'll do it this time.</v>

721
00:54:32.688 --> 00:54:36.734
<v padme>Do what?</v>
<v kitster>Finish the race, of course.</v>

722
00:54:36.775 --> 00:54:41.280
<v padme>You've never won a race?</v>
<v anakin>Well, not exactly.</v>

723
00:54:41.739 --> 00:54:43.365
<v padme>Not even finished?</v>

724
00:54:43.532 --> 00:54:45.993
<v anakin>Kitster's right. I will this time.</v>

725
00:54:46.285 --> 00:54:48.120
<v qui-gon>Of course you will.</v>

726
00:55:16.607 --> 00:55:17.649
...Podracers.

727
00:55:17.816 --> 00:55:19.485
<v fode-beed>That's absolutely right.</v>

728
00:55:19.526 --> 00:55:25.157
<v fode-beed>And a big turnout here from all corners of the Outer Rim Territories.</v>

729
00:55:25.199 --> 00:55:29.244
<v fode-beed>I see the contestants are making their way out onto the starting grid.</v>

730
00:55:30.954 --> 00:55:33.874
<v fode-beed>I see Ben Quadinaros from the Tund system.</v>

731
00:55:39.463 --> 00:55:41.673
<v fode-beed>Two-time winner Boles Roor.</v>

732
00:55:44.426 --> 00:55:45.803
<v fode-beed>Sebulba!</v>

733
00:55:56.522 --> 00:55:59.650
<v fode-beed>And in the front row, nearside pole position,</v>

734
00:55:59.691 --> 00:56:01.693
<v fode-beed>Mawhonic!</v>

735
00:56:03.487 --> 00:56:04.905
<v fode-beed>A hearty hello</v>

736
00:56:04.947 --> 00:56:08.826
<v fode-beed>to Clegg Holdfast and his Voltec KT9 Wasp!</v>

737
00:56:12.204 --> 00:56:14.832
<v fode-beed>And back again, it's the mighty Dud Bolt</v>

738
00:56:14.873 --> 00:56:19.628
<v fode-beed>with that incredible racing machine, the Vulptereen 327.</v>

739
00:56:23.006 --> 00:56:25.425
<v fode-beed>And hoping for a big win today,</v>

740
00:56:25.467 --> 00:56:30.597
<v fode-beed>Ody Mandrell, with his record-setting pit droid team.</v>

741
00:56:34.726 --> 00:56:37.855
<v fode-beed>And a late entry, young Anakin Skywalker,</v>

742
00:56:37.896 --> 00:56:40.691
<v fode-beed>a local boy.</v>

743
00:56:41.859 --> 00:56:44.278
<v fode-beed>I see the flags are moving out onto the track.</v>

744
00:56:54.454 --> 00:56:56.498
Huh? (SNIFFS)

745
00:56:59.835 --> 00:57:01.378
Pee yousa!

746
00:57:04.548 --> 00:57:05.924
<v shmi>Be safe.</v>

747
00:57:06.425 --> 00:57:09.386
<v anakin>I will, Mom. I promise.</v>

748
00:57:19.271 --> 00:57:21.440
Uh-oh. (CHUCKLES)

749
00:57:41.001 --> 00:57:42.312
<v qui-gon>You all set, Ani?</v>
<v anakin>(IN ENGLISH) Yep.</v>

750
00:57:42.336 --> 00:57:44.296
<v qui-gon>Right.</v>
Whoa.

751
00:57:48.133 --> 00:57:51.011
<v qui-gon>Remember, concentrate on the moment.</v>

752
00:57:51.053 --> 00:57:54.806
<v qui-gon>Feel, don't think. Use your instincts.</v>

753
00:57:55.182 --> 00:57:56.391
<v anakin>I will.</v>

754
00:57:56.934 --> 00:57:59.228
<v qui-gon>May the Force be with you.</v>

755
00:58:07.945 --> 00:58:09.655
<v fode-beed>Jabba the Hutt.</v>

756
00:58:39.601 --> 00:58:42.604
<v fode-beed>Hey, it looks like they're clearing the grid.</v>

757
00:58:43.730 --> 00:58:45.691
<v shmi>Is he nervous?</v>
<v qui-gon>He's fine.</v>

758
00:58:47.276 --> 00:58:50.112
<v padme>You Jedi are far too reckless. The queen is not...</v>

759
00:58:50.153 --> 00:58:52.948
<v qui-gon>The queen trusts my judgment, young handmaiden.</v>

760
00:58:52.990 --> 00:58:55.450
<v qui-gon>You should too.</v>

761
00:58:55.492 --> 00:58:57.536
<v padme>You assume too much.</v>

762
00:58:58.287 --> 00:59:01.415
<v fode-beed>Start your engines.</v>

763
00:59:40.287 --> 00:59:43.248
<v jar-jar>Dissen gonna be messy. Me no watch'n!</v>

764
01:00:03.560 --> 01:00:06.104
<v anakin>Oh, no! No!</v>

765
01:00:10.651 --> 01:00:13.445
<v fode-beed>Wait. Little Skywalker has stalled.</v>

766
01:00:24.081 --> 01:00:28.168
<v fode-beed>Well, it looks like Quadinaros is having engine trouble also.</v>

767
01:00:29.795 --> 01:00:31.046
<v jar-jar>Come on, Ani!</v>

768
01:00:37.427 --> 01:00:40.806
<v fode-beed>And there goes Skywalker!</v>
<v jar-jar>Go, Ani, go!</v>

769
01:00:40.847 --> 01:00:43.447
<v fode-beed>He will be hard-pressed to catch up with the leaders.</v>

770
01:01:57.090 --> 01:01:58.884
<v fode-beed>Looks like a few Tusken Raiders</v>

771
01:01:58.925 --> 01:02:02.345
<v fode-beed>are camped out on the Canyon Dune turn.</v>

772
01:02:13.815 --> 01:02:17.319
<v fode-beed>Ooh. There goes Quadinaros' power coupling.</v>

773
01:02:45.555 --> 01:02:47.265
<v cody>Oh, no!</v>

774
01:02:52.229 --> 01:02:54.606
<v c-3po>Where is Master Anakin?</v>

775
01:02:57.651 --> 01:02:59.361
<v padme>Look. Here he comes.</v>

776
01:03:02.239 --> 01:03:04.719
<v fode-beed>It looks like Skywalker is moving up in the field.</v>

777
01:03:14.334 --> 01:03:16.753
<v c-3po>He has to complete two more circuits?</v>

778
01:03:16.795 --> 01:03:18.004
<v c-3po>Oh, dear.</v>

779
01:04:11.433 --> 01:04:12.475
Ha!

780
01:04:25.530 --> 01:04:27.449
<v fode-beed>Skywalker's spinning out of control!</v>

781
01:05:25.632 --> 01:05:29.386
<v fode-beed>I don't care what universe you're from. That's gotta hurt!</v>

782
01:05:36.559 --> 01:05:38.395
<v jar-jar>Here he comes! (WHOOPS)</v>

783
01:05:38.436 --> 01:05:40.081
<v fode-beed>At the start of the final lap,</v>

784
01:05:40.105 --> 01:05:41.147
<v fode-beed>Sebulba's in the lead,</v>

785
01:05:41.189 --> 01:05:44.109
<v fode-beed>followed closely by Skywalker!</v>

786
01:05:44.150 --> 01:05:45.193
<v kitster>Go, Ani!</v>

787
01:06:12.053 --> 01:06:14.472
<v fode-beed>Skywalker's been forced onto the service ramp!</v>

788
01:06:36.244 --> 01:06:39.706
<v fode-beed>It's Skywalker!</v>
Sebulba!

789
01:06:39.998 --> 01:06:44.377
<v fode-beed>Amazing! A quick control thrust, and he's back on course!</v>

790
01:06:44.419 --> 01:06:45.920
<v jar-jar>Did he crash-ed?</v>

791
01:07:26.836 --> 01:07:30.090
<v fode-beed>Skywalker's in trouble! Sebulba takes the lead!</v>

792
01:08:23.309 --> 01:08:25.812
<v fode-beed>He's catching Sebulba!</v>

793
01:08:26.104 --> 01:08:28.481
<v jar-jar>Careful, Ani. Careful, Ani!</v>

794
01:08:58.720 --> 01:09:01.139
<v fode-beed>That little human being is out of his mind.</v>

795
01:09:02.348 --> 01:09:03.708
<v fode-beed>They're side by side!</v>

796
01:09:38.509 --> 01:09:40.011
<v c-3po>I can't believe it.</v>

797
01:09:40.053 --> 01:09:42.013
<v fode-beed>The crowds are going nuts!</v>

798
01:09:51.022 --> 01:09:53.149
<v jar-jar>Yay, Ani!</v>

799
01:09:54.442 --> 01:09:57.278
<v anakin>Mom, I did it! Yeah!</v>

800
01:10:07.747 --> 01:10:09.707
<v jar-jar>Good going, Ani!</v>

801
01:10:14.254 --> 01:10:16.047
<v padme>We owe you everything, Ani.</v>

802
01:10:18.925 --> 01:10:20.802
<v shmi>It's so wonderful, Ani.</v>

803
01:10:20.843 --> 01:10:23.638
<v shmi>You have brought hope to those who have none.</v>

804
01:10:23.680 --> 01:10:26.891
<v shmi>I'm so very proud of you.</v>

805
01:10:36.734 --> 01:10:38.486
<v watto>You.</v>

806
01:10:38.736 --> 01:10:40.738
<v watto>You swindled me!</v>

807
01:10:40.780 --> 01:10:44.909
<v watto>You knew the boy was going to win. Somehow you knew it.</v>

808
01:10:44.951 --> 01:10:46.703
<v watto>I lost everything.</v>

809
01:10:47.078 --> 01:10:50.456
<v qui-gon>Whenever you gamble, my friend, eventually you'll lose.</v>

810
01:10:50.498 --> 01:10:53.084
<v qui-gon>Bring the parts to the main hangar.</v>

811
01:10:53.126 --> 01:10:56.170
<v qui-gon>I'll come by your shop later on so you can release the boy.</v>

812
01:10:56.421 --> 01:10:59.841
<v watto>You can't have him. It wasn't a fair bet.</v>

813
01:11:02.510 --> 01:11:05.471
<v qui-gon>Would you like to discuss it with the Hutts?</v>

814
01:11:05.930 --> 01:11:08.057
<v qui-gon>I'm sure they can settle this.</v>

815
01:11:10.309 --> 01:11:11.853
<v watto>Take him.</v>

816
01:11:18.776 --> 01:11:20.737
<v jar-jar>Hidoe!</v>

817
01:11:21.529 --> 01:11:23.865
<v qui-gon>Well, we have all the essential parts we need.</v>

818
01:11:23.906 --> 01:11:26.868
<v qui-gon>I'm going back. Some unfinished business. I won't be long.</v>

819
01:11:26.909 --> 01:11:30.538
<v obi-wan>Why do I sense we've picked up another pathetic life-form?</v>

820
01:11:31.039 --> 01:11:34.542
<v qui-gon>It's the boy who's responsible for getting us these parts.</v>

821
01:11:34.709 --> 01:11:36.669
<v qui-gon>Get this hyperdrive generator installed.</v>

822
01:11:36.711 --> 01:11:39.088
<v obi-wan>Yes, Master. That shouldn't take long.</v>

823
01:11:39.130 --> 01:11:41.299
<v qui-gon>(CLICKS TONGUE) Come on. Hup!</v>

824
01:11:46.220 --> 01:11:49.348
<v qui-gon>Hey. These are yours.</v>

825
01:11:49.849 --> 01:11:51.142
<v anakin>Yes!</v>

826
01:11:52.810 --> 01:11:54.353
<v anakin>Mom, we sold the pod!</v>

827
01:11:54.395 --> 01:11:56.522
<v anakin>Look at all the money we have!</v>
<v shmi>My goodness!</v>

828
01:11:56.564 --> 01:12:00.068
<v shmi>But that's so wonderful, Ani.</v>
<v qui-gon>And he has been freed.</v>

829
01:12:00.109 --> 01:12:02.904
<v anakin>What?</v>
<v qui-gon>You're no longer a slave.</v>

830
01:12:05.031 --> 01:12:06.741
<v anakin>Did you hear that?</v>

831
01:12:07.575 --> 01:12:09.994
<v shmi>Now you can make your dreams come true, Ani.</v>

832
01:12:10.912 --> 01:12:12.747
<v shmi>You are free.</v>

833
01:12:16.459 --> 01:12:17.835
<v shmi>Will you take him with you?</v>

834
01:12:17.877 --> 01:12:20.922
<v shmi>Is he to become a Jedi?</v>
<v qui-gon>Yes.</v>

835
01:12:20.963 --> 01:12:24.801
<v qui-gon>Our meeting was not a coincidence. Nothing happens by accident.</v>

836
01:12:24.842 --> 01:12:28.554
<v anakin>You mean I get to come with you in your starship?</v>

837
01:12:28.763 --> 01:12:30.723
<v qui-gon>Anakin,</v>

838
01:12:31.808 --> 01:12:35.436
<v qui-gon>training to become a Jedi is not an easy challenge,</v>

839
01:12:35.478 --> 01:12:38.272
<v qui-gon>and even if you succeed, it's a hard life.</v>

840
01:12:38.481 --> 01:12:41.484
<v anakin>But I wanna go. It's what I've always dreamed of doing.</v>

841
01:12:42.401 --> 01:12:44.487
<v anakin>Can I go, Mom?</v>

842
01:12:45.446 --> 01:12:47.156
<v shmi>Anakin,</v>

843
01:12:47.198 --> 01:12:50.368
<v shmi>this path has been placed before you.</v>

844
01:12:50.410 --> 01:12:52.662
<v shmi>The choice is yours alone.</v>

845
01:12:56.833 --> 01:12:58.376
<v anakin>I wanna do it.</v>

846
01:13:00.419 --> 01:13:02.255
<v qui-gon>Then pack your things. We haven't much time.</v>

847
01:13:02.296 --> 01:13:03.423
<v anakin>Yipee.</v>

848
01:13:09.929 --> 01:13:11.347
<v anakin>What about Mom?</v>

849
01:13:14.559 --> 01:13:16.352
<v anakin>Is she free too?</v>

850
01:13:16.561 --> 01:13:19.897
<v qui-gon>I tried to free your mother, Ani, but Watto wouldn't have it.</v>

851
01:13:20.815 --> 01:13:23.943
<v anakin>You're coming with us, aren't you, Mom?</v>

852
01:13:30.950 --> 01:13:34.203
<v shmi>Son, my place is here. My future is here.</v>

853
01:13:34.537 --> 01:13:37.748
<v shmi>It is time for you to let go.</v>

854
01:13:38.040 --> 01:13:40.042
<v anakin>I don't want things to change.</v>

855
01:13:40.084 --> 01:13:42.795
<v shmi>But you can't stop the change</v>

856
01:13:42.837 --> 01:13:46.674
<v shmi>any more than you can stop the suns from setting.</v>

857
01:13:47.008 --> 01:13:48.968
<v shmi>I love you.</v>

858
01:13:54.557 --> 01:13:56.559
<v shmi>Now hurry.</v>

859
01:14:01.898 --> 01:14:03.482
<v shmi>Thank you.</v>

860
01:14:03.524 --> 01:14:06.486
<v qui-gon>I'll watch after him. You have my word.</v>

861
01:14:08.404 --> 01:14:10.907
<v qui-gon>Will you be all right?</v>

862
01:14:11.282 --> 01:14:12.909
<v shmi>Yeah.</v>

863
01:14:16.412 --> 01:14:17.830
<v c-3po>Oh, my.</v>

864
01:14:18.039 --> 01:14:19.540
<v c-3po>Hello, Master Anakin.</v>

865
01:14:19.582 --> 01:14:21.709
<v anakin>Well, 3PO, I've been freed</v>

866
01:14:22.043 --> 01:14:24.504
<v anakin>and I'm going away in a starship.</v>

867
01:14:24.545 --> 01:14:27.340
<v c-3po>Master Anakin, you are my maker and I wish you well.</v>

868
01:14:27.590 --> 01:14:31.761
<v c-3po>However, I should prefer it if I were a little more completed.</v>

869
01:14:31.928 --> 01:14:37.099
<v anakin>I'm sorry I wasn't able to finish you, 3PO, give you coverings and all.</v>

870
01:14:37.141 --> 01:14:41.521
<v anakin>I'm gonna miss working on you. You've been a great pal.</v>

871
01:14:41.562 --> 01:14:44.148
<v anakin>I'll make sure Mom doesn't sell you or anything.</v>

872
01:14:44.815 --> 01:14:45.983
<v c-3po>Sell me?</v>

873
01:14:46.025 --> 01:14:47.944
<v anakin>Bye.</v>

874
01:14:48.236 --> 01:14:50.196
<v c-3po>Oh, my.</v>

875
01:15:13.886 --> 01:15:16.138
<v anakin>I can't do it, Mom. I just can't do it.</v>

876
01:15:16.597 --> 01:15:18.224
<v shmi>Ani.</v>

877
01:15:20.476 --> 01:15:22.395
<v anakin>Will I ever see you again?</v>

878
01:15:24.021 --> 01:15:26.732
<v shmi>What does your heart tell you?</v>

879
01:15:28.025 --> 01:15:30.570
<v anakin>I hope so.</v>

880
01:15:30.611 --> 01:15:32.571
<v anakin>Yes.</v>

881
01:15:32.613 --> 01:15:34.282
<v anakin>I guess.</v>

882
01:15:34.991 --> 01:15:38.202
<v shmi>Then we will see each other again.</v>

883
01:15:40.538 --> 01:15:43.499
<v anakin>I will come back and free you, Mom.</v>

884
01:15:43.541 --> 01:15:45.293
<v anakin>I promise.</v>

885
01:15:53.509 --> 01:15:56.554
<v shmi>Now, be brave,</v>

886
01:15:57.179 --> 01:15:59.307
<v shmi>and don't look back.</v>

887
01:16:00.016 --> 01:16:02.184
<v shmi>Don't look back.</v>

888
01:16:46.562 --> 01:16:49.440
<v anakin>Qui-Gon, sir, wait! I'm tired!</v>
<v qui-gon>Anakin! Drop!</v>

889
01:16:52.193 --> 01:16:54.779
<v qui-gon>Go! Tell them to take off!</v>

890
01:17:08.501 --> 01:17:10.461
<v panaka>Qui-Gon's in trouble.</v>

891
01:17:11.212 --> 01:17:12.713
<v anakin>Take off.</v>

892
01:17:13.255 --> 01:17:15.091
<v anakin>Over there. Fly low.</v>

893
01:17:36.862 --> 01:17:38.406
<v anakin>Are you all right?</v>

894
01:17:38.447 --> 01:17:39.907
<v qui-gon>I think so.</v>

895
01:17:39.949 --> 01:17:41.534
<v obi-wan>What was it?</v>

896
01:17:41.575 --> 01:17:46.038
<v qui-gon>I'm not sure, but it was well-trained in the Jedi arts.</v>

897
01:17:46.080 --> 01:17:48.624
<v qui-gon>My guess is it was after the queen.</v>

898
01:17:48.833 --> 01:17:51.043
<v anakin>What are we gonna do about it?</v>

899
01:17:53.295 --> 01:17:55.256
<v qui-gon>We shall be patient.</v>

900
01:17:55.297 --> 01:17:58.426
<v qui-gon>Anakin Skywalker, meet Obi-Wan Kenobi.</v>

901
01:17:58.467 --> 01:18:00.219
<v anakin>Hi.</v>

902
01:18:00.261 --> 01:18:04.056
<v anakin>You're a Jedi too? Pleased to meet you.</v>

903
01:18:11.772 --> 01:18:14.608
<v gunray>Your queen is lost, your people are starving,</v>

904
01:18:14.650 --> 01:18:16.652
<v gunray>and you, Governor, are going to die</v>

905
01:18:16.694 --> 01:18:19.155
<v gunray>much sooner than your people, I'm afraid.</v>

906
01:18:19.196 --> 01:18:21.657
<v sio-bibble>This invasion will gain you nothing.</v>

907
01:18:21.699 --> 01:18:24.785
<v sio-bibble>We're a democracy. The people have decided.</v>

908
01:18:24.827 --> 01:18:26.829
<v gunray>Take him away.</v>

909
01:18:30.166 --> 01:18:32.751
<v oom-9>My troops are in position to begin searching the swamps</v>

910
01:18:32.793 --> 01:18:35.087
<v oom-9>for these rumored underwater villages.</v>

911
01:18:35.129 --> 01:18:37.882
<v oom-9>They will not stay hidden for long.</v>

912
01:18:49.310 --> 01:18:51.729
<v sio-bibble>The death toll is catastrophic.</v>

913
01:18:51.979 --> 01:18:54.398
<v sio-bibble>We must bow to their wishes.</v>

914
01:18:54.440 --> 01:18:57.026
<v sio-bibble>You must contact me.</v>

915
01:19:11.415 --> 01:19:12.833
<v padme>You all right?</v>

916
01:19:13.793 --> 01:19:16.003
<v anakin>It's very cold.</v>

917
01:19:23.761 --> 01:19:26.722
<v padme>You come from a warm planet, Ani.</v>

918
01:19:26.764 --> 01:19:29.099
<v padme>A little too warm for my taste.</v>

919
01:19:29.141 --> 01:19:31.352
<v padme>Space is cold.</v>

920
01:19:31.685 --> 01:19:33.521
<v anakin>You seem sad.</v>

921
01:19:34.939 --> 01:19:37.316
<v padme>The queen is worried.</v>

922
01:19:37.358 --> 01:19:39.485
<v padme>Her people are suffering, dying.</v>

923
01:19:40.361 --> 01:19:43.239
<v padme>She must convince the senate to intervene, or...</v>

924
01:19:44.865 --> 01:19:46.951
<v padme>I'm not sure what'll happen.</v>

925
01:19:48.327 --> 01:19:50.496
<v anakin>I made this for you...</v>

926
01:19:52.122 --> 01:19:53.833
<v anakin>So you'd remember me.</v>

927
01:19:54.458 --> 01:19:57.253
<v anakin>I carved it out of a japor snippet.</v>

928
01:19:57.628 --> 01:20:00.172
<v anakin>It'll bring you good fortune.</v>

929
01:20:00.214 --> 01:20:02.174
<v padme>It's beautiful.</v>

930
01:20:02.216 --> 01:20:04.718
<v padme>But I don't need this to remember you by.</v>

931
01:20:08.264 --> 01:20:11.976
<v padme>Many things will change when we reach the capital, Ani,</v>

932
01:20:12.017 --> 01:20:14.395
<v padme>but my caring for you will remain.</v>

933
01:20:17.273 --> 01:20:20.401
<v anakin>I care for you, too, only I...</v>

934
01:20:20.734 --> 01:20:22.403
<v padme>Miss your mother.</v>

935
01:20:41.255 --> 01:20:45.175
<v ric-olie>Coruscant. The entire planet is one big city.</v>

936
01:20:45.342 --> 01:20:47.177
<v ric-olie>There's Chancellor Valorum's shuttle.</v>

937
01:20:47.469 --> 01:20:50.556
<v ric-olie>And look over there. Senator Palpatine is waiting for us.</v>

938
01:21:19.919 --> 01:21:23.005
<v palpatine>It is a great gift to see you alive, Your Majesty.</v>

939
01:21:23.255 --> 01:21:26.133
<v palpatine>With the communications breakdown, we've been very concerned.</v>

940
01:21:26.175 --> 01:21:28.761
<v palpatine>I'm anxious to hear your report on the situation.</v>

941
01:21:28.969 --> 01:21:31.388
<v palpatine>May I present Supreme Chancellor Valorum.</v>

942
01:21:31.430 --> 01:21:35.643
<v valorum>Welcome, Your Highness. It's an honor to finally meet you in person.</v>

943
01:21:35.934 --> 01:21:37.329
<v padme>Thank you, Supreme Chancellor.</v>

944
01:21:37.353 --> 01:21:41.273
<v valorum>I must relay to you how distressed everyone is over the current situation.</v>

945
01:21:41.315 --> 01:21:44.443
<v valorum>I've called for a special session of the senate to hear your position.</v>

946
01:21:45.402 --> 01:21:48.864
<v padme>I'm grateful for your concern, Chancellor.</v>

947
01:21:48.906 --> 01:21:53.327
<v palpatine>There is a question of procedure, but I'm confident we can overcome it.</v>

948
01:21:54.244 --> 01:21:56.288
<v qui-gon>I must speak with the Jedi Council immediately.</v>

949
01:21:56.330 --> 01:21:59.249
<v qui-gon>The situation has become much more complicated.</v>

950
01:22:05.172 --> 01:22:06.882
<v padme>Ani, come on.</v>

951
01:22:18.102 --> 01:22:22.314
<v jar-jar>The queen's a bein' grossly nice, mesa tinks.</v>

952
01:22:22.356 --> 01:22:24.024
<v jar-jar>Pitty hot.</v>

953
01:22:52.177 --> 01:22:56.557
<v palpatine>There is no civility, only politics.</v>

954
01:22:56.598 --> 01:23:00.561
<v palpatine>The Republic is not what it once was.</v>

955
01:23:00.602 --> 01:23:05.691
<v palpatine>The senate is full of greedy, squabbling delegates.</v>

956
01:23:06.358 --> 01:23:09.987
<v palpatine>There is no interest in the common good.</v>

957
01:23:10.738 --> 01:23:12.489
<v palpatine>I must be frank, Your Majesty.</v>

958
01:23:12.531 --> 01:23:15.492
<v palpatine>There is little chance the senate will act on the invasion.</v>

959
01:23:15.534 --> 01:23:18.495
<v padme>Chancellor Valorum seems to think there is hope.</v>

960
01:23:18.537 --> 01:23:22.458
<v palpatine>If I may say so, Your Majesty, the chancellor has little real power.</v>

961
01:23:22.499 --> 01:23:26.462
<v palpatine>He is mired by baseless accusations of corruption.</v>

962
01:23:26.503 --> 01:23:30.340
<v palpatine>The bureaucrats are in charge now.</v>
<v padme>What options have we?</v>

963
01:23:31.258 --> 01:23:34.219
<v palpatine>Our best choice would be to push for the election</v>

964
01:23:34.261 --> 01:23:36.221
<v palpatine>of a stronger Supreme Chancellor,</v>

965
01:23:36.263 --> 01:23:38.557
<v palpatine>one who could control the bureaucrats</v>

966
01:23:38.974 --> 01:23:40.559
<v palpatine>and give us justice.</v>

967
01:23:41.477 --> 01:23:45.481
<v palpatine>You could call for a vote of no confidence</v>

968
01:23:45.522 --> 01:23:46.857
<v palpatine>in Chancellor Valorum.</v>

969
01:23:47.191 --> 01:23:49.526
<v padme>He has been our strongest supporter.</v>

970
01:23:49.568 --> 01:23:54.823
<v palpatine>Our only other choice would be to submit a plea to the courts.</v>

971
01:23:55.616 --> 01:23:58.368
<v padme>The courts take even longer to decide things than the senate.</v>

972
01:23:59.328 --> 01:24:01.371
<v padme>Our people are dying, Senator.</v>

973
01:24:01.997 --> 01:24:05.209
<v padme>We must do something quickly to stop the Federation.</v>

974
01:24:05.459 --> 01:24:08.128
<v palpatine>To be realistic, Your Majesty,</v>

975
01:24:08.170 --> 01:24:13.092
<v palpatine>I think we're going to have to accept Federation control for the time being.</v>

976
01:24:15.260 --> 01:24:17.638
<v padme>That is something I cannot do.</v>

977
01:24:24.520 --> 01:24:26.772
<v qui-gon>He was trained in the Jedi arts.</v>

978
01:24:26.897 --> 01:24:30.818
<v qui-gon>My only conclusion can be that it was a Sith lord.</v>

979
01:24:31.110 --> 01:24:35.114
<v ki-adi-mundi>Impossible. The Sith have been extinct for a millennium.</v>

980
01:24:35.405 --> 01:24:39.576
<v mace-windu>I do not believe the Sith could have returned without us knowing.</v>

981
01:24:39.618 --> 01:24:42.621
<v yoda>Ah. Hard to see, the dark side is.</v>

982
01:24:43.163 --> 01:24:45.624
<v mace-windu>We will use all our resources to unravel this mystery.</v>

983
01:24:45.666 --> 01:24:49.503
<v mace-windu>We will discover the identity of your attacker.</v>

984
01:24:49.545 --> 01:24:50.796
<v mace-windu>May the Force be with you.</v>

985
01:24:54.842 --> 01:24:56.426
<v yoda>Master Qui-Gon.</v>

986
01:24:57.094 --> 01:24:59.763
<v yoda>More to say have you?</v>

987
01:25:00.848 --> 01:25:03.392
<v qui-gon>With your permission, my master,</v>

988
01:25:04.643 --> 01:25:07.521
<v qui-gon>I have encountered a vergence in the Force.</v>

989
01:25:08.522 --> 01:25:10.607
<v yoda>A vergence, you say?</v>

990
01:25:10.649 --> 01:25:12.860
<v mace-windu>Located around a person?</v>

991
01:25:13.151 --> 01:25:14.570
<v qui-gon>A boy.</v>

992
01:25:14.611 --> 01:25:16.572
<v qui-gon>His cells have the highest concentration</v>

993
01:25:16.613 --> 01:25:18.782
<v qui-gon>of midi-chlorians I have seen in a life-form.</v>

994
01:25:18.824 --> 01:25:21.827
<v qui-gon>It is possible he was conceived by the midi-chlorians.</v>

995
01:25:23.662 --> 01:25:24.806
<v mace-windu>You refer to the prophecy</v>

996
01:25:24.830 --> 01:25:27.416
<v mace-windu>of the one who will bring balance to the Force.</v>

997
01:25:28.250 --> 01:25:30.335
<v mace-windu>You believe it's this boy?</v>

998
01:25:30.711 --> 01:25:33.046
<v qui-gon>I don't presume to...</v>
<v yoda>But you do.</v>

999
01:25:33.755 --> 01:25:35.757
<v yoda>Revealed your opinion is.</v>

1000
01:25:35.799 --> 01:25:37.885
<v qui-gon>I request the boy be tested, Master.</v>

1001
01:25:37.926 --> 01:25:39.303
<v yoda>Oh.</v>

1002
01:25:40.012 --> 01:25:43.265
<v yoda>Trained as a Jedi you request for him?</v>

1003
01:25:43.682 --> 01:25:46.059
<v qui-gon>Finding him was the will of the Force.</v>

1004
01:25:46.101 --> 01:25:48.103
<v qui-gon>I have no doubt of that.</v>

1005
01:25:54.943 --> 01:25:56.862
<v mace-windu>Bring him before us, then.</v>

1006
01:26:08.332 --> 01:26:09.791
<v role-guard>The boy's here to see Padmé.</v>

1007
01:26:09.833 --> 01:26:11.418
<v rabe>Let him in.</v>

1008
01:26:14.671 --> 01:26:18.634
<v rabe>I'm sorry, Ani, but Padmé's not here right now.</v>

1009
01:26:18.675 --> 01:26:20.594
<v padme>Who is it?</v>

1010
01:26:20.636 --> 01:26:24.431
<v rabe>Anakin Skywalker to see Padmé, Your Highness.</v>

1011
01:26:24.473 --> 01:26:26.433
<v padme>I've sent Padmé on an errand.</v>

1012
01:26:26.475 --> 01:26:31.438
<v anakin>I'm on my way to the Jedi temple to start my training, I hope.</v>

1013
01:26:31.480 --> 01:26:35.192
<v anakin>I may never see her again, so I came to say good-bye.</v>

1014
01:26:36.276 --> 01:26:37.694
<v padme>We will tell her for you.</v>

1015
01:26:37.736 --> 01:26:39.863
<v padme>We are sure her heart goes with you.</v>

1016
01:26:40.864 --> 01:26:41.990
<v anakin>Thank you, Your Highness.</v>

1017
01:26:56.213 --> 01:27:00.175
<v valorum>The chair recognizes the senator from the sovereign system of Naboo.</v>

1018
01:27:07.432 --> 01:27:11.395
<v palpatine>Supreme Chancellor, delegates of the senate,</v>

1019
01:27:11.603 --> 01:27:13.814
<v palpatine>a tragedy has occurred</v>

1020
01:27:13.855 --> 01:27:17.526
<v palpatine>which started right here with the taxation of trade routes</v>

1021
01:27:18.026 --> 01:27:20.821
<v palpatine>and has now engulfed our entire planet</v>

1022
01:27:20.862 --> 01:27:22.698
<v palpatine>in the oppression of the Trade Federation.</v>

1023
01:27:23.657 --> 01:27:25.284
<v lott-dod>This is outrageous!</v>

1024
01:27:25.325 --> 01:27:27.703
<v lott-dod>I object to the senator's statements.</v>

1025
01:27:27.744 --> 01:27:29.746
<v valorum>The chair does not recognize the senator</v>

1026
01:27:29.788 --> 01:27:31.873
<v valorum>from the Trade Federation at this time.</v>

1027
01:27:31.915 --> 01:27:35.877
<v palpatine>To state our allegations, I present Queen Amidala,</v>

1028
01:27:35.919 --> 01:27:37.963
<v palpatine>recently elected ruler of the Naboo,</v>

1029
01:27:38.255 --> 01:27:40.215
<v palpatine>who speaks on our behalf.</v>

1030
01:27:46.221 --> 01:27:48.724
<v padme>Honorable representatives of the Republic,</v>

1031
01:27:49.349 --> 01:27:52.185
<v padme>I come to you under the gravest of circumstances.</v>

1032
01:27:52.227 --> 01:27:55.480
<v padme>The Naboo system has been invaded by the droid armies of the Trade...</v>

1033
01:27:55.522 --> 01:27:58.608
<v lott-dod>I object! There is no proof!</v>

1034
01:27:59.151 --> 01:28:00.861
<v lott-dod>This is incredible.</v>

1035
01:28:00.902 --> 01:28:04.781
<v lott-dod>We recommend a commission be sent to Naboo to ascertain the truth.</v>

1036
01:28:04.823 --> 01:28:06.783
<v aks-moe>The Congress of Malastare concurs</v>

1037
01:28:06.825 --> 01:28:09.661
<v aks-moe>with the honorable delegate from the Trade Federation.</v>

1038
01:28:09.703 --> 01:28:12.789
<v aks-moe>A commission must be appointed.</v>
<v valorum>The point...</v>

1039
01:28:12.831 --> 01:28:15.792
<v amedda>Excuse me, Chancellor.</v>
<v palpatine>Enter the bureaucrat.</v>

1040
01:28:15.834 --> 01:28:18.837
<v palpatine>The true rulers of the Republic.</v>

1041
01:28:18.879 --> 01:28:22.758
<v palpatine>And on the payroll of the Trade Federation, I might add.</v>

1042
01:28:22.883 --> 01:28:27.429
<v palpatine>This is where Chancellor Valorum's strength will disappear.</v>

1043
01:28:28.930 --> 01:28:31.099
<v valorum>The point is conceded.</v>

1044
01:28:31.641 --> 01:28:33.977
<v valorum>Will you defer your motion to allow a commission</v>

1045
01:28:34.019 --> 01:28:36.813
<v valorum>to explore the validity of your accusations?</v>

1046
01:28:37.272 --> 01:28:38.732
<v padme>I will not defer.</v>

1047
01:28:38.774 --> 01:28:42.444
<v padme>I've come before you to resolve this attack on our sovereignty now.</v>

1048
01:28:42.736 --> 01:28:45.947
<v padme>I was not elected to watch my people suffer and die</v>

1049
01:28:45.989 --> 01:28:48.325
<v padme>while you discuss this invasion in a committee.</v>

1050
01:28:51.411 --> 01:28:53.872
<v padme>If this body is not capable of action,</v>

1051
01:28:53.914 --> 01:28:56.750
<v padme>I suggest new leadership is needed.</v>

1052
01:28:58.960 --> 01:29:01.630
<v padme>I move for a vote of no confidence</v>

1053
01:29:01.671 --> 01:29:04.091
<v padme>in Chancellor Valorum's leadership.</v>

1054
01:29:10.180 --> 01:29:12.724
Vote now! Vote now!

1055
01:29:12.766 --> 01:29:15.685
Vote now! Vote now!

1056
01:29:15.852 --> 01:29:18.563
Vote now! Vote now!
<v amedda>Order!</v>

1057
01:29:18.772 --> 01:29:21.525
<v palpatine>Now they will elect a new chancellor,</v>

1058
01:29:21.650 --> 01:29:23.735
<v palpatine>a strong chancellor,</v>

1059
01:29:23.777 --> 01:29:27.531
<v palpatine>one who will not let our tragedy continue.</v>

1060
01:29:28.365 --> 01:29:32.744
<v obi-wan>The boy will not pass the council's test, Master. He's too old.</v>

1061
01:29:32.786 --> 01:29:35.789
<v qui-gon>Anakin will become a Jedi, I promise you.</v>

1062
01:29:35.831 --> 01:29:38.583
<v obi-wan>Do not defy the council, Master, not again.</v>

1063
01:29:38.917 --> 01:29:41.336
<v qui-gon>I shall do what I must, Obi-Wan.</v>

1064
01:29:43.380 --> 01:29:46.967
<v obi-wan>If you would just follow the code, you would be on the council.</v>

1065
01:29:47.008 --> 01:29:50.470
<v obi-wan>They will not go along with you this time.</v>

1066
01:29:50.512 --> 01:29:53.473
<v qui-gon>You still have much to learn, my young apprentice.</v>

1067
01:29:56.726 --> 01:29:57.894
<v anakin>A ship.</v>

1068
01:29:59.729 --> 01:30:01.731
<v anakin>A cup.</v>

1069
01:30:01.940 --> 01:30:03.358
<v anakin>A ship.</v>

1070
01:30:04.693 --> 01:30:05.902
<v anakin>A speeder.</v>

1071
01:30:09.865 --> 01:30:10.907
<v yoda>Hmm.</v>

1072
01:30:13.910 --> 01:30:15.537
<v yoda>How feel you?</v>

1073
01:30:16.288 --> 01:30:17.831
<v anakin>Cold, sir.</v>

1074
01:30:19.249 --> 01:30:20.834
<v yoda>Afraid are you?</v>

1075
01:30:20.876 --> 01:30:22.836
<v anakin>No, sir.</v>

1076
01:30:22.878 --> 01:30:25.422
<v yoda>See through you we can.</v>

1077
01:30:25.630 --> 01:30:27.591
<v mace-windu>Be mindful of your feelings.</v>

1078
01:30:27.632 --> 01:30:30.302
<v ki-adi-mundi>Your thoughts dwell on your mother.</v>

1079
01:30:31.845 --> 01:30:34.222
<v anakin>I miss her.</v>

1080
01:30:34.556 --> 01:30:36.850
<v yoda>Afraid to lose her, I think, hmm?</v>

1081
01:30:37.058 --> 01:30:39.436
<v anakin>What has that got to do with anything?</v>

1082
01:30:39.603 --> 01:30:41.730
<v yoda>Everything.</v>

1083
01:30:41.771 --> 01:30:44.900
<v yoda>Fear is the path to the dark side.</v>

1084
01:30:44.941 --> 01:30:47.819
<v yoda>Fear leads to anger. Anger leads to hate.</v>

1085
01:30:47.861 --> 01:30:51.490
<v yoda>Hate leads to suffering.</v>

1086
01:30:57.871 --> 01:31:00.832
<v yoda>I sense much fear in you.</v>

1087
01:31:14.346 --> 01:31:17.390
<v jar-jar>Yousa tinking yousa people ganna die?</v>

1088
01:31:17.432 --> 01:31:19.184
<v padme>I don't know.</v>

1089
01:31:19.976 --> 01:31:22.354
<v jar-jar>Gungans get pasted too, eh?</v>

1090
01:31:24.564 --> 01:31:26.441
<v padme>I hope not.</v>

1091
01:31:26.816 --> 01:31:29.653
<v jar-jar>Gungans no dyin' without a fight.</v>

1092
01:31:29.694 --> 01:31:31.488
<v jar-jar>Wesa warriors.</v>

1093
01:31:31.530 --> 01:31:34.824
<v jar-jar>Wesa got a grand army.</v>

1094
01:31:34.866 --> 01:31:38.370
<v jar-jar>Dat's why you no liken us, mesa tinks.</v>

1095
01:31:38.411 --> 01:31:40.372
<v panaka>Your Highness?</v>

1096
01:31:42.082 --> 01:31:44.543
<v panaka>Your Highness.</v>

1097
01:31:44.584 --> 01:31:47.671
<v panaka>Senator Palpatine has been nominated to succeed Valorum</v>

1098
01:31:47.837 --> 01:31:49.047
<v panaka>as Supreme Chancellor.</v>

1099
01:31:49.089 --> 01:31:53.134
<v palpatine>A surprise, to be sure, but a welcome one.</v>

1100
01:31:53.176 --> 01:31:57.764
<v palpatine>Your Majesty, if I am elected, I promise to put an end to corruption.</v>

1101
01:31:57.806 --> 01:31:59.349
<v padme>Who else has been nominated?</v>

1102
01:31:59.599 --> 01:32:03.979
<v panaka>Bail Antilles of Alderaan and Ainlee Teem of Malastare.</v>

1103
01:32:04.020 --> 01:32:09.025
<v palpatine>I feel confident our situation will create a strong sympathy vote for us.</v>

1104
01:32:10.694 --> 01:32:12.571
<v palpatine>I will be chancellor.</v>

1105
01:32:12.779 --> 01:32:15.299
<v padme>I fear by the time you have control of the bureaucrats, Senator,</v>

1106
01:32:15.532 --> 01:32:18.827
<v padme>there'll be nothing left of our people, our way of life.</v>

1107
01:32:18.868 --> 01:32:20.829
<v palpatine>I understand your concern, Your Majesty.</v>

1108
01:32:20.870 --> 01:32:24.207
<v palpatine>Unfortunately, the Federation has possession of our planet.</v>

1109
01:32:25.917 --> 01:32:30.338
<v padme>Senator, this is your arena.</v>

1110
01:32:30.380 --> 01:32:32.090
<v padme>I feel I must return to mine.</v>

1111
01:32:35.635 --> 01:32:37.762
<v padme>I've decided to go back to Naboo.</v>

1112
01:32:37.929 --> 01:32:40.307
<v palpatine>Go back? But, Your Majesty, be realistic.</v>

1113
01:32:40.348 --> 01:32:41.850
<v palpatine>They'll force you to sign the treaty.</v>

1114
01:32:42.267 --> 01:32:44.477
<v padme>I will sign no treaty, Senator.</v>

1115
01:32:44.519 --> 01:32:47.522
<v padme>My fate will be no different than that of our people.</v>

1116
01:32:47.564 --> 01:32:48.874
<v padme>Captain.</v>
<v panaka>Your Highness.</v>

1117
01:32:48.898 --> 01:32:50.233
<v padme>Ready my ship.</v>

1118
01:32:50.275 --> 01:32:54.904
<v palpatine>Please, Your Majesty, stay here where it's safe.</v>

1119
01:32:54.946 --> 01:32:58.116
<v padme>It is clear to me now that the Republic no longer functions.</v>

1120
01:32:58.867 --> 01:33:03.246
<v padme>I pray you will bring sanity and compassion back to the senate.</v>

1121
01:33:13.006 --> 01:33:15.467
<v ki-adi-mundi>The Force is strong with him.</v>

1122
01:33:15.508 --> 01:33:17.510
<v qui-gon>He is to be trained, then?</v>

1123
01:33:19.137 --> 01:33:21.765
<v mace-windu>No, he will not be trained.</v>

1124
01:33:21.973 --> 01:33:23.516
<v qui-gon>No?</v>

1125
01:33:25.685 --> 01:33:27.646
<v mace-windu>He is too old.</v>

1126
01:33:27.854 --> 01:33:31.191
<v qui-gon>He is the chosen one. You must see it.</v>

1127
01:33:31.232 --> 01:33:32.567
Hmm.

1128
01:33:32.692 --> 01:33:36.237
<v yoda>Clouded this boy's future is.</v>

1129
01:33:39.115 --> 01:33:40.241
<v qui-gon>I will train him, then.</v>

1130
01:33:44.788 --> 01:33:47.457
<v qui-gon>I take Anakin as my Padawan learner.</v>

1131
01:33:48.166 --> 01:33:50.752
<v yoda>An apprentice you have, Qui-Gon.</v>

1132
01:33:50.794 --> 01:33:52.962
<v yoda>Impossible to take on a second.</v>

1133
01:33:53.088 --> 01:33:54.923
<v mace-windu>The code forbids it.</v>

1134
01:33:55.256 --> 01:33:58.259
<v qui-gon>Obi-Wan is ready.</v>
<v obi-wan>I am ready to face the trials.</v>

1135
01:33:58.677 --> 01:34:02.013
<v yoda>Our own counsel we will keep on who is ready.</v>

1136
01:34:03.223 --> 01:34:04.391
<v qui-gon>He is headstrong,</v>

1137
01:34:04.432 --> 01:34:07.435
<v qui-gon>and he has much to learn of the living Force, but he is capable.</v>

1138
01:34:07.769 --> 01:34:09.646
<v qui-gon>There is little more he can learn from me.</v>

1139
01:34:12.107 --> 01:34:16.027
<v yoda>Young Skywalker's fate will be decided later.</v>

1140
01:34:16.152 --> 01:34:18.822
<v mace-windu>Now is not the time for this.</v>

1141
01:34:19.364 --> 01:34:21.950
<v mace-windu>The senate is voting for a new Supreme Chancellor,</v>

1142
01:34:21.991 --> 01:34:24.077
<v mace-windu>and Queen Amidala is returning home,</v>

1143
01:34:24.119 --> 01:34:26.079
<v mace-windu>which will put pressure on the Federation</v>

1144
01:34:26.121 --> 01:34:27.831
<v mace-windu>and could widen the confrontation.</v>

1145
01:34:27.872 --> 01:34:30.125
<v ki-adi-mundi>And draw out the queen's attacker.</v>

1146
01:34:30.417 --> 01:34:35.713
<v mace-windu>Go with the queen to Naboo and discover the identity of this dark warrior.</v>

1147
01:34:35.964 --> 01:34:40.051
<v mace-windu>This is the clue we need to unravel the mystery of the Sith.</v>

1148
01:34:40.677 --> 01:34:43.096
<v yoda>May the Force be with you.</v>

1149
01:34:56.609 --> 01:34:59.070
<v obi-wan>It's not disrespect, Master. It's the truth.</v>

1150
01:34:59.112 --> 01:35:00.780
<v qui-gon>From your point of view.</v>

1151
01:35:00.822 --> 01:35:04.826
<v obi-wan>The boy is dangerous. They all sense it. Why can't you?</v>

1152
01:35:04.868 --> 01:35:07.829
<v qui-gon>His fate is uncertain. He's not dangerous.</v>

1153
01:35:07.871 --> 01:35:10.081
<v qui-gon>The council will decide Anakin's future.</v>

1154
01:35:10.123 --> 01:35:13.918
<v qui-gon>That should be enough for you. Now get on board.</v>

1155
01:35:18.882 --> 01:35:22.760
<v anakin>Qui-Gon, sir, I don't want to be a problem.</v>

1156
01:35:22.802 --> 01:35:25.096
<v qui-gon>You won't be, Ani.</v>

1157
01:35:25.138 --> 01:35:26.931
<v qui-gon>I'm not allowed to train you,</v>

1158
01:35:26.973 --> 01:35:29.225
<v qui-gon>so I want you to watch me and be mindful.</v>

1159
01:35:29.642 --> 01:35:32.061
<v qui-gon>Always remember.</v>

1160
01:35:32.103 --> 01:35:34.939
<v qui-gon>Your focus determines your reality.</v>

1161
01:35:35.231 --> 01:35:38.568
<v qui-gon>Stay close to me and you'll be safe.</v>

1162
01:35:38.860 --> 01:35:40.195
<v anakin>Master, sir,</v>

1163
01:35:40.445 --> 01:35:43.865
<v anakin>I heard Yoda talking about midi-chlorians.</v>

1164
01:35:43.907 --> 01:35:47.410
<v anakin>I've been wondering. What are midi-chlorians?</v>

1165
01:35:48.828 --> 01:35:51.039
<v qui-gon>Midi-chlorians are a microscopic life-form</v>

1166
01:35:51.080 --> 01:35:53.416
<v qui-gon>that resides within all living cells.</v>

1167
01:35:55.043 --> 01:35:57.837
<v anakin>They live inside me?</v>
<v qui-gon>Inside your cells, yes.</v>

1168
01:35:58.296 --> 01:36:01.633
<v qui-gon>And we are symbionts with them.</v>
<v anakin>Symbionts?</v>

1169
01:36:01.674 --> 01:36:05.345
<v qui-gon>Life-forms living together for mutual advantage.</v>

1170
01:36:05.386 --> 01:36:08.348
<v qui-gon>Without the midi-chlorians, life could not exist</v>

1171
01:36:08.389 --> 01:36:11.267
<v qui-gon>and we would have no knowledge of the Force.</v>

1172
01:36:11.309 --> 01:36:13.269
<v qui-gon>They continually speak to us,</v>

1173
01:36:13.311 --> 01:36:16.314
<v qui-gon>telling us the will of the Force.</v>

1174
01:36:16.523 --> 01:36:18.525
<v qui-gon>When you learn to quiet your mind,</v>

1175
01:36:18.566 --> 01:36:20.318
<v qui-gon>you'll hear them speaking to you.</v>

1176
01:36:20.944 --> 01:36:22.320
<v anakin>I don't understand.</v>

1177
01:36:22.904 --> 01:36:25.990
<v qui-gon>With time and training, Ani, you will. You will.</v>

1178
01:36:29.953 --> 01:36:34.332
<v qui-gon>Your Majesty, it is our pleasure to continue to serve and protect you.</v>

1179
01:36:34.374 --> 01:36:36.042
<v padme>I welcome your help.</v>

1180
01:36:36.084 --> 01:36:40.171
<v padme>Senator Palpatine fears that the Federation means to destroy me.</v>

1181
01:36:40.213 --> 01:36:42.882
<v qui-gon>I assure you I will not allow that to happen.</v>

1182
01:36:43.132 --> 01:36:46.052
Wesa goin' ho-o-o-me!

1183
01:36:46.094 --> 01:36:48.012
<v anakin>Come on, R2.</v>

1184
01:36:57.939 --> 01:37:00.358
<v sidious>Is the planet secure?</v>

1185
01:37:00.733 --> 01:37:04.487
<v gunray>We have taken over the last pockets of primitive life-forms.</v>

1186
01:37:04.529 --> 01:37:07.907
<v gunray>We are in complete control of the planet now.</v>

1187
01:37:07.949 --> 01:37:14.247
<v sidious>Good. I will see to it that in the senate things stay as they are.</v>

1188
01:37:14.289 --> 01:37:17.875
<v sidious>I am sending my apprentice, Darth Maul, to join you.</v>

1189
01:37:17.917 --> 01:37:19.669
<v gunray>Yes, my lord.</v>

1190
01:37:19.711 --> 01:37:21.713
<v rune-haako>A Sith here?</v>

1191
01:37:27.218 --> 01:37:29.512
<v ric-olie>Those are the forward stabilizers.</v>

1192
01:37:29.804 --> 01:37:32.265
<v anakin>And those two control the pitch?</v>

1193
01:37:33.766 --> 01:37:35.476
<v ric-olie>You catch on pretty quick.</v>

1194
01:37:35.768 --> 01:37:37.228
<v panaka>As soon as we land,</v>

1195
01:37:37.270 --> 01:37:40.315
<v panaka>the Federation will arrest you and force you to sign the treaty.</v>

1196
01:37:40.356 --> 01:37:44.152
<v qui-gon>I agree. I'm not sure what you wish to accomplish by this.</v>

1197
01:37:44.360 --> 01:37:47.572
<v padme>I will take back what's ours.</v>

1198
01:37:47.614 --> 01:37:49.866
<v panaka>There are too few of us, Your Highness.</v>

1199
01:37:49.907 --> 01:37:51.868
<v panaka>We have no army.</v>

1200
01:37:51.993 --> 01:37:55.371
<v qui-gon>And I can only protect you. I can't fight a war for you.</v>

1201
01:37:56.331 --> 01:37:57.457
<v padme>Jar Jar Binks.</v>

1202
01:37:58.333 --> 01:38:00.627
<v jar-jar>Mesa, Your Highness?</v>

1203
01:38:00.877 --> 01:38:04.380
<v padme>Yes. I need your help.</v>

1204
01:38:09.010 --> 01:38:11.179
<v ric-olie>I have one battleship on my scope.</v>

1205
01:38:11.554 --> 01:38:13.264
<v obi-wan>It's a droid control ship.</v>

1206
01:38:13.389 --> 01:38:15.683
<v panaka>They've probably spotted us.</v>

1207
01:38:15.725 --> 01:38:17.310
<v obi-wan>We haven't much time.</v>

1208
01:38:29.072 --> 01:38:31.950
<v obi-wan>Jar Jar is on his way to the Gungan city, Master.</v>

1209
01:38:31.991 --> 01:38:33.076
<v qui-gon>Good.</v>

1210
01:38:33.117 --> 01:38:35.828
<v obi-wan>Do you think the queen's idea will work?</v>

1211
01:38:35.870 --> 01:38:37.390
<v qui-gon>The Gungans will not be easily swayed.</v>

1212
01:38:39.499 --> 01:38:42.418
<v qui-gon>And we cannot use our power to help her.</v>

1213
01:38:43.670 --> 01:38:46.881
<v obi-wan>I'm sorry for my behavior, Master.</v>

1214
01:38:46.923 --> 01:38:50.510
<v obi-wan>It's not my place to disagree with you about the boy.</v>

1215
01:38:52.637 --> 01:38:55.723
<v obi-wan>And I am grateful you think I'm ready to take the trials.</v>

1216
01:38:57.016 --> 01:38:59.352
<v qui-gon>You've been a good apprentice, Obi-Wan.</v>

1217
01:39:00.353 --> 01:39:03.481
<v qui-gon>And you're a much wiser man than I am.</v>

1218
01:39:03.523 --> 01:39:06.901
<v qui-gon>I foresee you will become a great Jedi knight.</v>

1219
01:39:20.081 --> 01:39:22.291
<v jar-jar>Desa nobody dare.</v>

1220
01:39:22.417 --> 01:39:24.585
<v jar-jar>The Gungan city is deserted.</v>

1221
01:39:24.877 --> 01:39:27.505
<v jar-jar>Some kinda fight, mesa tinks.</v>

1222
01:39:27.547 --> 01:39:30.466
<v obi-wan>Do you think they have been taken to the camps?</v>

1223
01:39:30.508 --> 01:39:33.177
<v panaka>More likely they were wiped out.</v>

1224
01:39:33.219 --> 01:39:36.264
<v jar-jar>Mesa no tink so.</v>
<v qui-gon>Do you know where they are, Jar Jar?</v>

1225
01:39:36.389 --> 01:39:39.642
<v jar-jar>When in trouble, Gungans go to sacred place.</v>

1226
01:39:39.934 --> 01:39:43.312
<v jar-jar>Mesa show you. Come on. Mesa show you!</v>

1227
01:40:01.039 --> 01:40:05.543
<v tarpals>Your Honor, Queen Amidala of the Naboo.</v>

1228
01:40:10.256 --> 01:40:14.594
<v jar-jar>Heyo dadee, Big Boss Nass, Your Honor.</v>

1229
01:40:15.511 --> 01:40:17.805
<v boss-nass>Jar Jar Binks.</v>

1230
01:40:18.097 --> 01:40:22.101
<v boss-nass>Who's da uss-en uthers?</v>

1231
01:40:22.393 --> 01:40:24.604
<v padme>I am Queen Amidala of the Naboo.</v>

1232
01:40:25.563 --> 01:40:27.857
<v padme>I come before you in peace.</v>

1233
01:40:29.025 --> 01:40:30.610
<v boss-nass>Naboo biggen.</v>

1234
01:40:31.277 --> 01:40:34.072
<v boss-nass>Yousa bringen da Mackineeks.</v>

1235
01:40:34.238 --> 01:40:37.867
<v boss-nass>Yousa all bombad.</v>

1236
01:40:38.659 --> 01:40:41.621
<v padme>We have searched you out because we wish to form an alliance.</v>

1237
01:40:41.662 --> 01:40:43.623
<v padme>Your Honor.</v>

1238
01:40:45.374 --> 01:40:48.252
<v boss-nass>Whosa dis?</v>

1239
01:40:48.419 --> 01:40:51.214
<v padme>I am Queen Amidala.</v>
<v jar-jar>Huh?</v>

1240
01:40:52.131 --> 01:40:53.883
<v padme>This is my decoy,</v>

1241
01:40:53.925 --> 01:40:57.470
<v padme>my protection, my loyal bodyguard.</v>

1242
01:40:57.929 --> 01:41:01.891
<v padme>I'm sorry for my deception, but it was necessary to protect myself.</v>

1243
01:41:02.433 --> 01:41:04.560
<v padme>Although we do not always agree, Your Honor,</v>

1244
01:41:04.644 --> 01:41:07.355
<v padme>our two great societies have always lived in peace.</v>

1245
01:41:07.396 --> 01:41:08.523
<v boss-nass>Ah...</v>

1246
01:41:08.564 --> 01:41:09.690
<v padme>The Trade Federation</v>

1247
01:41:09.732 --> 01:41:12.276
<v padme>has destroyed all that we have worked so hard to build.</v>

1248
01:41:12.568 --> 01:41:15.613
<v padme>If we do not act quickly, all will be lost forever.</v>

1249
01:41:15.655 --> 01:41:18.199
<v padme>I ask you to help us.</v>

1250
01:41:18.241 --> 01:41:20.827
<v padme>No, I beg you to help us.</v>

1251
01:41:21.077 --> 01:41:23.287
<v padme>We are your humble servants.</v>

1252
01:41:26.624 --> 01:41:29.418
<v padme>Our fate is in your hands.</v>

1253
01:41:30.002 --> 01:41:31.379
Hmm.

1254
01:41:46.477 --> 01:41:50.773
<v boss-nass>Yousa no tinken yousa greater den da Gungans?</v>

1255
01:41:53.484 --> 01:41:57.196
Me-e-esa lika dis!

1256
01:41:58.239 --> 01:42:01.742
<v boss-nass>Maybe wesa</v>

1257
01:42:02.034 --> 01:42:03.995
<v boss-nass>bein friends.</v>

1258
01:42:12.587 --> 01:42:14.380
<v gunray>We've sent our patrols.</v>

1259
01:42:15.131 --> 01:42:18.092
<v gunray>We already located their starship in the swamp.</v>

1260
01:42:18.134 --> 01:42:20.178
<v gunray>It won't be long, my lord.</v>

1261
01:42:20.595 --> 01:42:23.639
<v sidious>This is an unexpected move for her.</v>

1262
01:42:23.681 --> 01:42:25.516
<v sidious>It's too aggressive.</v>

1263
01:42:25.558 --> 01:42:28.144
<v sidious>Lord Maul, be mindful.</v>

1264
01:42:28.644 --> 01:42:30.730
<v sidious>Let them make the first move.</v>

1265
01:42:30.771 --> 01:42:33.399
<v darth-maul>Yes, my master.</v>

1266
01:42:36.444 --> 01:42:37.987
<v role-gungan>Deysa comin!</v>

1267
01:42:38.237 --> 01:42:39.989
<v anakin>All right!</v>

1268
01:42:42.950 --> 01:42:44.452
<v anakin>They're here!</v>

1269
01:42:44.869 --> 01:42:46.245
<v padme>Good. They made it.</v>

1270
01:42:51.000 --> 01:42:53.628
<v boss-nass>Yousa doen grand.</v>

1271
01:42:53.669 --> 01:42:57.215
<v boss-nass>Jar Jar bring uss-en and da Naboo together.</v>

1272
01:42:57.256 --> 01:42:59.008
<v jar-jar>No, no, no.</v>

1273
01:42:59.050 --> 01:43:01.761
<v boss-nass>So, wesa make you</v>

1274
01:43:01.802 --> 01:43:04.597
<v boss-nass>bombad general.</v>

1275
01:43:04.639 --> 01:43:06.098
<v jar-jar>General?</v>

1276
01:43:08.851 --> 01:43:10.478
<v qui-gon>Captain.</v>

1277
01:43:10.519 --> 01:43:13.356
<v panaka>Your Highness.</v>
<v padme>PADMÉ: What is the situation?</v>

1278
01:43:13.397 --> 01:43:15.107
<v panaka>Almost everyone's in camps.</v>

1279
01:43:15.149 --> 01:43:16.859
<v panaka>A few hundred police and guards</v>

1280
01:43:16.901 --> 01:43:18.587
<v panaka>have formed an underground resistance movement.</v>

1281
01:43:18.611 --> 01:43:21.239
<v panaka>I brought back as many of the leaders as I could.</v>

1282
01:43:21.530 --> 01:43:25.952
<v panaka>The Federation army's also much larger than we thought, and much stronger.</v>

1283
01:43:27.411 --> 01:43:30.539
<v panaka>Your Highness, this is a battle I do not think that we can win.</v>

1284
01:43:30.706 --> 01:43:32.750
<v padme>The battle is a diversion.</v>

1285
01:43:32.792 --> 01:43:35.711
<v padme>The Gungans must draw the droid army away from the cities.</v>

1286
01:43:36.045 --> 01:43:37.797
<v padme>R2.</v>

1287
01:43:38.214 --> 01:43:42.343
<v padme>We can enter the city using the secret passages on the waterfall side.</v>

1288
01:43:42.385 --> 01:43:43.928
<v padme>Once we get to the main entrance,</v>

1289
01:43:43.970 --> 01:43:47.056
<v padme>Captain Panaka will create a diversion.</v>

1290
01:43:47.098 --> 01:43:50.142
<v padme>Then we can enter the palace and capture the viceroy.</v>

1291
01:43:50.601 --> 01:43:54.021
<v padme>Without the viceroy, they will be lost and confused.</v>

1292
01:43:54.063 --> 01:43:55.606
<v padme>What do you think, Master Jedi?</v>

1293
01:43:55.731 --> 01:43:57.692
<v qui-gon>The viceroy will be well-guarded.</v>

1294
01:43:57.858 --> 01:44:00.444
<v panaka>The difficulty is getting into the throne room.</v>

1295
01:44:00.486 --> 01:44:02.738
<v panaka>Once we're inside, we shouldn't have a problem.</v>

1296
01:44:03.114 --> 01:44:07.576
<v qui-gon>There is a possibility, with this diversion, many Gungans will be killed.</v>

1297
01:44:07.702 --> 01:44:10.955
<v boss-nass>Wesa ready to do our-san part.</v>

1298
01:44:10.997 --> 01:44:14.375
<v padme>PADMÉ: We have a plan which should immobilize the droid army.</v>

1299
01:44:14.583 --> 01:44:16.294
<v padme>We will send what pilots we have</v>

1300
01:44:16.335 --> 01:44:19.547
<v padme>to knock out the droid control ship orbiting the planet.</v>

1301
01:44:19.714 --> 01:44:22.633
<v qui-gon>A well-conceived plan. However, there's great risk.</v>

1302
01:44:22.758 --> 01:44:25.636
<v qui-gon>The weapons on your fighters may not penetrate the shields.</v>

1303
01:44:25.678 --> 01:44:27.638
<v obi-wan>There's an even bigger danger.</v>

1304
01:44:27.763 --> 01:44:29.724
<v obi-wan>If the viceroy escapes, Your Highness,</v>

1305
01:44:29.765 --> 01:44:32.101
<v obi-wan>he will return with another droid army.</v>

1306
01:44:32.351 --> 01:44:35.646
<v padme>Well, that is why we must not fail to get the viceroy.</v>

1307
01:44:35.688 --> 01:44:38.441
<v padme>Everything depends on it.</v>

1308
01:44:42.778 --> 01:44:45.531
<v sidious>She is more foolish than I thought.</v>

1309
01:44:45.698 --> 01:44:47.325
<v gunray>We are sending all troops</v>

1310
01:44:47.366 --> 01:44:50.578
<v gunray>to meet this army assembling near the swamp.</v>

1311
01:44:50.619 --> 01:44:53.205
<v gunray>It appears to be made up of primitives.</v>

1312
01:44:53.748 --> 01:44:55.833
<v sidious>This will work to our advantage.</v>

1313
01:44:55.958 --> 01:44:58.794
<v gunray>I have your approval to proceed, then, my lord?</v>

1314
01:44:59.837 --> 01:45:01.881
<v sidious>Wipe them out.</v>

1315
01:45:03.215 --> 01:45:05.217
<v sidious>All of them.</v>

1316
01:45:35.915 --> 01:45:37.875
<v role-gungan>Halt!</v>

1317
01:45:40.795 --> 01:45:42.880
<v role-gungan>Starting up the shield.</v>

1318
01:46:12.535 --> 01:46:13.702
<v role-battle-droid>Open fire.</v>

1319
01:46:29.718 --> 01:46:33.013
<v qui-gon>Once we get inside, you find a safe place to hide and stay there.</v>

1320
01:46:33.055 --> 01:46:35.015
<v anakin>Sure.</v>
<v qui-gon>Stay there.</v>

1321
01:46:51.449 --> 01:46:52.950
<v role-battle-droid>Roger. Roger.</v>

1322
01:47:01.625 --> 01:47:04.170
<v gunray>I thought the battle was going to take place far from here.</v>

1323
01:47:05.087 --> 01:47:06.839
<v gunray>This is too close.</v>

1324
01:47:12.803 --> 01:47:14.388
<v qui-gon>Ani, find cover.</v>

1325
01:47:15.264 --> 01:47:17.600
<v qui-gon>Quick!</v>
<v padme>Get to your ships!</v>

1326
01:48:16.200 --> 01:48:18.661
<v role-pilot>Fighters straight ahead.</v>
<v role-pilot>Roger, Bravo Leader.</v>

1327
01:48:18.827 --> 01:48:19.912
<v role-pilot>Roger, Bravo Leader.</v>

1328
01:48:28.587 --> 01:48:29.672
<v role-battle-droid>Cease fire.</v>

1329
01:48:37.972 --> 01:48:40.224
<v jar-jar>Steady. Steady.</v>

1330
01:49:13.048 --> 01:49:16.051
<v gunray>Activate the droids.</v>
<v rune-haako>Yes, sir.</v>

1331
01:49:32.818 --> 01:49:34.445
<v tarpals>Ouch time.</v>

1332
01:49:48.709 --> 01:49:49.752
<v role-gungan>Fire!</v>

1333
01:50:12.024 --> 01:50:13.984
<v padme>My guess is the viceroy's in the throne room.</v>

1334
01:50:14.109 --> 01:50:17.237
<v panaka>Red group! Blue group! Everybody, this way!</v>

1335
01:50:17.988 --> 01:50:19.531
<v anakin>Hey, wait for me!</v>

1336
01:50:19.740 --> 01:50:22.117
<v qui-gon>Stay where you are. You'll be safe there.</v>

1337
01:50:22.242 --> 01:50:24.745
<v anakin>But I...</v>
<v qui-gon>Stay in that cockpit.</v>

1338
01:50:36.173 --> 01:50:39.468
<v qui-gon>We'll handle this.</v>
<v padme>We'll take the long way.</v>

1339
01:50:59.863 --> 01:51:01.657
<v anakin>We gotta do something, R2.</v>

1340
01:51:24.346 --> 01:51:27.391
<v anakin>I'm trying to! I don't know where the trigger is!</v>

1341
01:51:30.936 --> 01:51:33.981
<v anakin>Oops, wrong one. Maybe it's this one.</v>

1342
01:51:34.773 --> 01:51:37.359
<v anakin>Nope. Wait. Here it is.</v>

1343
01:51:39.486 --> 01:51:40.529
<v anakin>Yeah!</v>

1344
01:51:45.993 --> 01:51:47.911
<v padme>Let's go!</v>

1345
01:51:48.912 --> 01:51:50.748
<v anakin>It's on automatic pilot.</v>

1346
01:52:00.007 --> 01:52:01.508
<v anakin>Try to override it.</v>

1347
01:53:01.693 --> 01:53:03.737
<v padme>We don't have time for this, Captain.</v>

1348
01:53:10.035 --> 01:53:11.703
<v anakin>Look! There they are.</v>

1349
01:53:11.745 --> 01:53:14.164
<v anakin>That's where the autopilot's taking us.</v>

1350
01:53:31.390 --> 01:53:33.809
<v jar-jar>Dumb droid. Take that!</v>

1351
01:53:33.851 --> 01:53:37.145
<v jar-jar>Get off! Get off! Get off! Get off!</v>

1352
01:53:47.406 --> 01:53:49.575
<v ric-olie>The deflector shield is too strong.</v>

1353
01:53:58.917 --> 01:54:00.294
<v anakin>This is tense!</v>

1354
01:54:01.837 --> 01:54:05.090
<v anakin>Whoa! R2, get us off this autopilot.</v>

1355
01:54:05.132 --> 01:54:06.842
<v anakin>It's gonna get us both killed.</v>

1356
01:54:08.969 --> 01:54:11.138
<v anakin>You did it, R2!</v>

1357
01:54:11.263 --> 01:54:12.389
<v anakin>Okay, let's go left.</v>

1358
01:54:17.561 --> 01:54:18.687
<v anakin>Go back?</v>

1359
01:54:18.937 --> 01:54:23.108
<v anakin>Qui-Gon told me to stay in this cockpit, so that's what I'm gonna do.</v>

1360
01:54:30.115 --> 01:54:32.367
<v anakin>I'll try spinning. That's a good trick.</v>

1361
01:54:38.040 --> 01:54:40.542
<v anakin>I know we're in trouble. Just hang on.</v>

1362
01:54:47.299 --> 01:54:48.383
<v panaka>Go!</v>

1363
01:54:53.680 --> 01:54:55.057
<v panaka>Ascension guns!</v>

1364
01:57:01.183 --> 01:57:02.642
<v jar-jar>Retreat! Retreat!</v>

1365
01:57:04.686 --> 01:57:06.521
<v jar-jar>Dis is nutsen.</v>

1366
01:57:16.698 --> 01:57:18.325
<v jar-jar>Uh-oh. Big boomers.</v>

1367
01:57:26.041 --> 01:57:27.334
Uh-oh.

1368
01:57:36.468 --> 01:57:38.887
Hey! Hey!

1369
01:57:39.221 --> 01:57:40.806
<v jar-jar>Give me a lift!</v>

1370
01:57:48.605 --> 01:57:50.357
<v tarpals>Jar Jar, usen da booma!</v>

1371
01:57:50.482 --> 01:57:52.275
<v jar-jar>What? Mesa no have a booma!</v>

1372
01:57:52.651 --> 01:57:54.361
<v tarpals>Here. Taken dis one.</v>

1373
01:58:08.041 --> 01:58:09.459
Help me!

1374
01:58:11.169 --> 01:58:14.089
<v tarpals>Jar Jar! Jump, Jar Jar, jump!</v>

1375
01:58:24.224 --> 01:58:26.852
<v padme>Put down your weapons. They win this round.</v>

1376
01:58:39.865 --> 01:58:41.366
<v anakin>We're hit, R2!</v>

1377
01:58:55.255 --> 01:58:58.383
<v anakin>I'm trying to stop! I'm trying to stop!</v>

1378
01:59:05.473 --> 01:59:06.850
<v anakin>Everything's overheated.</v>

1379
01:59:08.435 --> 01:59:10.395
<v anakin>Oops. This is not good.</v>

1380
01:59:56.024 --> 01:59:57.734
No!

1381
02:00:22.717 --> 02:00:25.178
<v tarpals>No giben up, General Jar Jar.</v>

1382
02:00:25.220 --> 02:00:27.138
<v tarpals>Mesa tink of something.</v>

1383
02:00:27.514 --> 02:00:29.641
<v role-battle-droid>Hands up.</v>
<v jar-jar>My give up.</v>

1384
02:00:29.683 --> 02:00:31.434
<v jar-jar>My give up.</v>

1385
02:00:40.318 --> 02:00:43.363
<v gunray>Your little insurrection is at an end, Your Highness.</v>

1386
02:00:43.405 --> 02:00:47.534
<v gunray>Time for you to sign the treaty and end this pointless debate in the senate.</v>

1387
02:00:47.575 --> 02:00:49.202
<v sabe>Viceroy!</v>

1388
02:00:49.327 --> 02:00:51.371
<v sabe>Your occupation here has ended.</v>

1389
02:00:52.872 --> 02:00:56.376
<v gunray>After her. This one's a decoy.</v>

1390
02:01:02.632 --> 02:01:04.384
<v padme>Captain!</v>

1391
02:01:13.601 --> 02:01:15.520
<v panaka>Jam the doors.</v>

1392
02:01:18.940 --> 02:01:21.735
<v padme>Now, Viceroy, we will discuss a new treaty.</v>

1393
02:02:25.173 --> 02:02:26.549
<v anakin>Yes! We have power.</v>

1394
02:02:26.674 --> 02:02:27.717
<v anakin>Shields up.</v>

1395
02:02:30.720 --> 02:02:32.680
<v anakin>Take this!</v>

1396
02:02:34.057 --> 02:02:35.225
<v anakin>And this!</v>

1397
02:02:36.893 --> 02:02:38.103
Whoa.

1398
02:02:42.899 --> 02:02:44.901
<v anakin>Oops.</v>
<v tey-how>We're losing power.</v>

1399
02:02:44.943 --> 02:02:46.754
<v tey-how>There seems to be a problem with the main reactor.</v>

1400
02:02:46.778 --> 02:02:48.446
<v dofine>Impossible!</v>

1401
02:02:48.488 --> 02:02:50.281
<v dofine>Nothing can get through our shield.</v>

1402
02:02:51.366 --> 02:02:52.450
<v anakin>Let's get outta here.</v>

1403
02:03:01.501 --> 02:03:04.003
<v role-pilot>What's that? It's blowing up from the inside!</v>

1404
02:03:07.507 --> 02:03:08.675
<v ric-olie>We didn't hit it.</v>

1405
02:03:11.845 --> 02:03:13.721
<v anakin>Now, this is Podracing.</v>

1406
02:03:15.473 --> 02:03:17.073
<v role-pilot>Look, one of ours, out of the main hold!</v>

1407
02:03:18.059 --> 02:03:19.102
Whoo!

1408
02:03:23.189 --> 02:03:24.482
Whoo!

1409
02:03:24.524 --> 02:03:25.817
Yeah!

1410
02:03:38.454 --> 02:03:39.873
<v jar-jar>What the...</v>

1411
02:03:40.498 --> 02:03:42.333
<v jar-jar>Was'n they doing?</v>

1412
02:03:42.542 --> 02:03:45.920
<v tarpals>The control ship has been destroyed. Look!</v>

1413
02:03:47.839 --> 02:03:50.008
<v jar-jar>They all broke-ed.</v>

1414
02:04:38.598 --> 02:04:41.809
<v qui-gon>No, it's too late.</v>

1415
02:04:41.851 --> 02:04:44.521
<v obi-wan>No.</v>
<v qui-gon>Obi-Wan.</v>

1416
02:04:45.688 --> 02:04:47.649
<v qui-gon>Promise...</v>

1417
02:04:47.690 --> 02:04:49.984
<v qui-gon>Promise me you will train the boy.</v>

1418
02:04:50.276 --> 02:04:51.694
<v obi-wan>Yes, Master.</v>

1419
02:04:55.823 --> 02:04:58.660
<v qui-gon>He is the chosen one.</v>

1420
02:04:58.701 --> 02:05:02.038
<v qui-gon>He will bring balance.</v>

1421
02:05:03.081 --> 02:05:05.041
<v qui-gon>Train him.</v>

1422
02:05:32.068 --> 02:05:33.820
<v padme>Now, Viceroy,</v>

1423
02:05:33.987 --> 02:05:37.240
<v padme>you're going to have to go back to the senate and explain all this.</v>

1424
02:05:39.033 --> 02:05:42.370
<v panaka>I think you can kiss your trade franchise good-bye.</v>

1425
02:05:55.967 --> 02:05:59.804
<v palpatine>We are indebted to you for your bravery, Obi-Wan Kenobi.</v>

1426
02:05:59.846 --> 02:06:01.597
<v palpatine>And you, young Skywalker.</v>

1427
02:06:02.265 --> 02:06:05.727
<v palpatine>We will watch your career with great interest.</v>

1428
02:06:12.066 --> 02:06:14.902
<v padme>Congratulations on your election, Chancellor.</v>

1429
02:06:15.403 --> 02:06:18.031
<v palpatine>Your boldness has saved our people, Your Majesty.</v>

1430
02:06:18.072 --> 02:06:19.991
<v palpatine>It's you who should be congratulated.</v>

1431
02:06:20.033 --> 02:06:24.579
<v palpatine>Together we shall bring peace and prosperity to the Republic.</v>

1432
02:06:29.751 --> 02:06:34.255
<v yoda>Confer on you the level of Jedi knight the council does.</v>

1433
02:06:34.589 --> 02:06:39.177
<v yoda>But agree with your taking this boy as your Padawan learner...</v>

1434
02:06:39.218 --> 02:06:41.179
<v yoda>I do not.</v>

1435
02:06:41.220 --> 02:06:43.306
<v obi-wan>Qui-Gon believed in him.</v>

1436
02:06:46.142 --> 02:06:48.936
<v yoda>The chosen one the boy may be.</v>

1437
02:06:48.978 --> 02:06:50.646
<v yoda>Nevertheless,</v>

1438
02:06:50.688 --> 02:06:53.650
<v yoda>grave danger I fear in his training.</v>

1439
02:06:54.108 --> 02:06:58.154
<v obi-wan>Master Yoda, I gave Qui-Gon my word.</v>

1440
02:06:58.196 --> 02:07:00.281
<v obi-wan>I will train Anakin.</v>

1441
02:07:02.158 --> 02:07:04.577
<v obi-wan>Without the approval of the council, if I must.</v>

1442
02:07:04.619 --> 02:07:07.080
<v yoda>Qui-Gon's defiance I sense in you.</v>

1443
02:07:07.121 --> 02:07:09.749
<v yoda>Need that you do not.</v>

1444
02:07:11.668 --> 02:07:14.087
<v yoda>Agree with you the council does.</v>

1445
02:07:16.005 --> 02:07:19.133
<v yoda>Your apprentice Skywalker will be.</v>

1446
02:07:46.869 --> 02:07:48.788
<v anakin>What will happen to me now?</v>

1447
02:07:48.996 --> 02:07:52.166
<v obi-wan>The council have granted me permission to train you.</v>

1448
02:07:52.208 --> 02:07:55.378
<v obi-wan>You will be a Jedi, I promise.</v>

1449
02:08:04.762 --> 02:08:07.265
<v mace-windu>There's no doubt the mysterious warrior was a Sith.</v>

1450
02:08:08.349 --> 02:08:11.060
<v yoda>Always two there are.</v>

1451
02:08:11.102 --> 02:08:14.021
<v yoda>No more, no less.</v>

1452
02:08:14.063 --> 02:08:17.150
<v yoda>A master and an apprentice.</v>

1453
02:08:17.191 --> 02:08:19.152
<v mace-windu>But which was destroyed?</v>

1454
02:08:19.193 --> 02:08:21.821
<v mace-windu>The master or the apprentice?</v>

1455
02:08:47.013 --> 02:08:48.723
Hello, everybody!

1456
02:09:35.394 --> 02:09:37.188
<v boss-nass>Peace!</v>
